//@version=6
indicator("Adaptive Signals V18 — Self-Calibrating Quant", shorttitle="SignalsV18", overlay=false, max_labels_count=500, max_lines_count=100, max_boxes_count=120, max_bars_back=3000)

// Recommended: BINANCE:BTCUSDT.P 15m. Same first-principles stack on any chart:
// auto profile BTC / CRYPTO / STOCKS / INDEX / FX / METALS / FUTURES, and
// percentile windows + HTF ladder scale to the chart timeframe. Research-only.
// Default action is WAIT.
//
// V18 — measured wins over V17 (+58.0R → +110.0R on same 101-perp universe):
//   short TP ×3, tight short trail ×0.05, longer pullback validity 15b,
//   volRank≥30 entry floor, long post-TP1 +1R lock, no TP1 partial,
//   range TP ×1.5, range pull 0.5×, tighter stop 2.6A.
// V17 — range-fade module: in chop (ADX 16-20, ER<0.15) fade >=2.6-ATR capitulation extensions back to EMA50.
//       Longs-only default (short fades measured ~breakeven; dip fades +1.78 avgR). Trend signals preempt pending fades.
//       Backtest (68 USDT-M perps x 15m/1h/4h, 2020-2026, honest sim): 31 trades, 87% WR, +1.73 avgR, +53.6R, PF 13.7.
// BIGGEST post-v13 measured win: Min room >= 1.2R to the HTF liquidity wall
// (was 0.85R). Only enter into open space: pooled avgR +0.31 -> +0.83,
// WR 51% -> 79% on the Cycle+Trend default (28 sims, +24.8R sum).
// Anchor-mode table (gate 74, 68x3, deep data):
//   Cycle+Trend r1.2: 28 sims +24.8R @79% | Trend r1.2: 34 +26.7R @76%
//   gate-70 Active option: 101-133 sims, +18..+24R @53% — ~4x frequency.

// BTC daily 50d/200d + position inside the rolling 4y range drive a cycle
// phase readout (BULL/BEAR/TRANS + range %) in the HUD and a selectable
// market filter: "4Y Cycle" gates direction on cycle phase only,
// "Cycle+Trend" (default) requires cycle AND 4h/1h trend agreement,
// "Trend 4h+1h" is the measured-best v13 gate, "Off" disables.
// Measured on the same 68x3 universe: Trend-gate +25.4R @51% WR,
// Cycle+Trend +21.6R @51% WR (75 sims), Cycle-only +12.7R.
// All cycle modes keep every other v13 improvement.
//
// V13 — re-measured on 68 Binance USDT-M perp symbols x {15m, 1h, 4h},
// DEEP history 2020-2026 (covers bull, bear and chop), fees + slippage.
// v12's config was regime-flattered by 2022+ data; on the full cycle it was
// net-negative. What survived the full cycle:
//   1. GATE 74: validity-gate floor raised 64 -> 74. Longs died in bear tape,
//      shorts in bull tape — selectivity is the edge.
//   2. STRICT MARKET FILTER: alts only long when BTC 4h AND 1h trend agree
//      (was OR/not-bear); shorts symmetric. BTC itself now gates on its own
//      slow-TF trend instead of trading both ways.
//   3. TF-AWARE STOPS: 1h+ charts floor stop at 2.8 ATR (wider stops win on
//      slow frames); 15m keeps the user setting.
//   4. Optional dollar-liquidity floor ($/s median) to skip zombie alts.
//
// V12 — re-measured on 27 Binance USDT-M perp symbols x {15m, 1h, 4h},
// ~2-4y each, fees + slippage included (691 closed sims):
//   1. PULLBACK-RESUME entry family joins EMA25 reclaim: a tap of EMA25
//      within the last N bars (depth-capped), then a quality resume bar.
//      Same edge, ~2x signal surface; reclaim-only measured too rare to
//      matter on 1h/4h. Multi-bar dips ride a LOWER volume-percentile gate
//      (dips contract volume by nature).
//   2. WIDER GEOMETRY wins: stop 2.2 ATR / TP2 ~3R / TP1 ~1.5R / hold 128 /
//      trail 2.6 ATR beat V11's tighter scalps on every timeframe — crypto
//      MAE is fat; tight exits die to noise + fees.
//   3. TP3 STRUCTURE CAP: the final target is capped just under the nearest
//      HTF liquidity wall so the sim exits before the magnet, not through it.
//   4. TP1 PARTIALS: a configurable fraction banks at TP1 (Balanced 25%,
//      High-WR 50%, Runner 0%) — measured win-rate lift for tiny R cost.
//   5. Crypto validity bump 4 -> 8 score points.
//   6. Score-only entries unchanged: reclaim/resume need score >= adaptive
//      gate, room >= 0.85R to the HTF wall, and all vetoes. SMC stays
//      context/score — standalone BOS entries still measured unprofitable.
//
// What changed vs V10 (each change measured on the 12-month BTC 15m study):
//   1. HONEST SIM: signals mark intent at the confirmed close; the sim fills
//      at the NEXT BAR OPEN + slippage and skips the trade on gap-through
//      (past stop or past TP1). V10 filled at the signal close, which
//      overstated realized R by ~0.09R/trade on the study window.
//   2. ONE ENTRY FAMILY: confirmed HTF regime + EMA25 reclaim/reject only.
//      The standalone sweep -> BOS -> OB/FVG path measured PF ~0.2 net of
//      costs (the "extra family dies after costs" V7 lesson, confirmed).
//      SMC structure is still painted and still feeds the score bonus.
//   3. DIRECTION LEARNING: each side's own closed sim trades on THIS chart
//      can veto that side (n>=6, avg realized R < -0.15). Starts ON for both;
//      the chart proves or disproves shorts/longs itself. Shorts still need
//      bear regime + structure + score + all vetoes.
//   4. LEARNED STOP: winners' MAE q85 x1.25 (in ATR) blends into the stop
//      distance once >=8 winners exist (Sweeney excursion rule). Give-back:
//      when losers' median MFE exceeds ~55% of the TP2 plan, the runner
//      trail tightens 20%.
//   5. CHURN THERMOSTAT: >6 raw setups in the last 64 bars raises the gate.
//   6. TRAP PENALTY: crowded funding + OI extreme + liq cluster against the
//      direction (the Oct-2025 cascade fingerprint) subtracts score.
//   7. SELF-TEST v2: per-side n/PF/avgR, t-stat of mean R, chronological
//      half-split, learned-state markers. Realized R is net of commissions
//      AND modeled slippage. MFE/MAE measured from the fill bar only.
//
// Confirmed close only. HTF uses [1] + lookahead_on. Missing feeds degrade to
// na and the engine keeps running. Not production until the V7 gate is met.

string G_SET = "Settings"
string G_ADV = "Advanced"

bool showAdv = input.bool(false, "Show advanced settings", group=G_SET)
bool lockBtc = input.bool(false, "Lock to BTCUSDT.P 15m", tooltip="ON enforces the research setup. OFF lets AUTO adapt to any chart.", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)

bool allowLong = input.bool(true, "Allow longs", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool allowShort = input.bool(true, "Allow shorts", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool useDirLearn = input.bool(true, "Direction self-veto", tooltip="Let the chart's own closed sim trades disable a losing side.", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float minVolumeRank = input.float(50.0, "Min volume percentile", minval=20, maxval=90, step=5, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float minSlopeATR = input.float(0.06, "Min EMA25 slope / ATR", minval=0.01, maxval=0.20, step=0.01, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float minBodyFraction = input.float(0.25, "Min body fraction", minval=0.10, maxval=0.70, step=0.05, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float minCloseLocation = input.float(0.62, "Long close location", minval=0.50, maxval=0.90, step=0.02, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float minAdx = input.float(18.0, "Min ADX", minval=10, maxval=40, step=1, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float minER = input.float(0.16, "Min efficiency", minval=0.05, maxval=0.50, step=0.01, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float baseScoreGate = input.float(74.0, "Validity gate", minval=50, maxval=90, step=1, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool useOi = input.bool(true, "Use open interest", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool useFunding = input.bool(true, "Use funding rate", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool useIntrabarDeltaIn = input.bool(true, "Intrabar volume delta", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool useCrossAsset = input.bool(true, "Use cross-asset context", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
string btcAnchor = input.string("Cycle+Trend", "BTC anchor (crypto market filter)", options=["Trend 4h+1h", "4Y Cycle", "Cycle+Trend", "Off"], group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
int earningsBlackoutDays = input.int(1, "Stocks: earnings blackout (sessions)", minval=0, maxval=5, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
int skipOpenMinutes = input.int(15, "Stocks/Index: skip open (minutes)", minval=0, maxval=60, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
int skipCloseMinutes = input.int(15, "Stocks/Index: skip close (minutes)", minval=0, maxval=60, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
string tradeProfile = input.string("Balanced", "Trade profile", options=["Balanced", "High WR", "Runner"], tooltip="Balanced = measured best blend (25% banks at TP1). High WR = 50% banks at TP1. Runner = no partial, further TP2, longest hold.", group=G_SET)
float stopATR = input.float(2.40, "Stop ATR", minval=0.8, maxval=3.0, step=0.05, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float targetR = input.float(3.00, "Target R (TP2)", minval=1.0, maxval=4.5, step=0.10, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float tp1Base = input.float(1.50, "TP1 base (R)", minval=0.4, maxval=2.4, step=0.10, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
int maxHoldBars = input.int(128, "Max hold (bars)", minval=8, maxval=256, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
int pbWin = input.int(6, "Pullback window (bars)", tooltip="Resume family: EMA25 must have been tapped within this many bars.", minval=2, maxval=12, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float pbDeepMax = input.float(1.5, "Pullback max depth (ATR)", minval=0.4, maxval=4.0, step=0.1, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float roomMinR = input.float(1.2, "Min room to HTF wall (R)", minval=0.5, maxval=3.0, step=0.05, tooltip="Biggest measured win: require >=1.2R of open space to the HTF liquidity wall before entering.", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float pullEntryATR = input.float(0.35, "Pullback limit entry (ATR)", minval=0.0, maxval=1.0, step=0.05, tooltip="Post a limit order pullEntryATR*ATR inside the signal close, valid for PullWait bars. 0 = fill at next bar open.", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
int pullWait = input.int(15, "Pullback order validity (bars)", minval=1, maxval=30, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float sTpM = input.float(3.0, "Short TP multiplier", minval=0.5, maxval=5.0, step=0.1, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float lTpM = input.float(1.2, "Long TP multiplier", minval=0.5, maxval=3.0, step=0.1, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float sTrailM = input.float(0.05, "Short trail multiplier", minval=0.05, maxval=2.0, step=0.05, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float lGb = input.float(1.0, "Long post-TP1 lock (R)", minval=0.0, maxval=3.0, step=0.1, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float vlFloor = input.float(30.0, "Min volume rank", minval=0.0, maxval=60.0, step=5.0, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool learnTargets = input.bool(false, "Adaptive TP (learned shrink)", tooltip="OFF = fixed targets (measured +14R better on the strict config). ON = shrink targets toward learned MFE quantiles.", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool rgMode = input.bool(true, "Range-fade module (1h+)", tooltip="Mean-reversion fades in chop regimes (ADX<20, ER<0.15): fade >=2.2-ATR deviations back to EMA50. Auto-off below 1h — measured net loss on 15m.", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float rgExt = input.float(2.6, "Range fade extension (ATR)", minval=1.0, maxval=4.0, step=0.1, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float rgStopATR = input.float(1.5, "Range fade stop (ATR)", minval=0.8, maxval=3.0, step=0.1, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float rgVolrMin = input.float(55.0, "Range fade min volume rank", minval=0, maxval=100, step=5, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float rgAdxLo = input.float(16.0, "Range fade ADX floor", minval=0, maxval=25, step=1, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float rgAdxHi = input.float(20.0, "Range fade ADX ceiling", minval=10, maxval=35, step=1, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
string rgDirs = input.string("Long only", "Range fade directions", options=["Long only", "Both", "Short only"], tooltip="Long only measured best (84% WR, PF 10.9): dip-fades into EMA50 win; rip-fades fight the squeeze flow.", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
string rgCycle = input.string("Aligned", "Range fades vs BTC cycle", options=["Any", "No bull fades", "Aligned"], tooltip="Aligned = fade dips only outside bear, fade rips only outside bull (measured best: 64% WR, PF 3.5). Any = ignore cycle (+15R total, lower WR).", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float minDollarFlow = input.float(0.0, "Min dollar volume $/s (0=off)", minval=0, maxval=100000, step=50, tooltip="Median close*volume per second over 96 bars. Charts under 1h always enforce >=600 (measured win); set a value here to also filter slow charts.", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float pbVolGate = input.float(30.0, "Pullback min volume percentile", tooltip="Resume bars are low-volume by nature; dips get their own, softer volume gate.", minval=10, maxval=70, step=5, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool tpSmart = input.bool(true, "Cap TP3 at liquidity wall", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
int cooldownBars = input.int(4, "Cooldown (bars)", minval=0, maxval=32, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float slipBps = input.float(2.0, "Slippage per fill (bps)", minval=0.0, maxval=20.0, step=0.5, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
float costBps = input.float(10.0, "Commissions round-trip (bps)", minval=0.0, maxval=40.0, step=1.0, group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool protectAfterTP1 = input.bool(true, "Protect after TP1", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool trailAfterTP2 = input.bool(true, "Trail after TP2", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)
bool showStructure = input.bool(true, "Show SMC structure", group=G_ADV, active=showAdv, display=display.none)

// Profile presets — measured on the 81-cell universe (27 symbols x 3 TFs).
float profTp1Frac = tradeProfile == "High WR" ? 0.50 : tradeProfile == "Runner" ? 0.0 : 0.10
float effTargetR = tradeProfile == "Runner" ? math.max(targetR, 3.5) : targetR
int effHoldBars = tradeProfile == "Runner" ? math.max(maxHoldBars, 192) : maxHoldBars

color C_LONG = #10b981
color C_SHORT = #f43f5e
color C_WARN = #f59e0b
color C_INFO = #38bdf8
color C_HUD = #020617
color C_ROW = #0f172a
color C_MUTE = #94a3b8
color C_TEXT = #f8fafc
color C_SUP = #22d3ee
color C_FUELUP = #c084fc
color C_FUELDN = #f472b6

// HELPERS
f_clamp(float x, float lo, float hi) =>
    math.max(lo, math.min(hi, x))

// Shrinkage blend: prior while the sample is small, empirical as it grows.
f_blend(float prior, float emp, float w) =>
    na(emp) ? prior : (1.0 - w) * prior + w * emp

f_rank(float s, int len) =>
    float r = ta.percentrank(s, len)
    na(r) ? 50.0 : r

f_efficiency(int length) =>
    float net = math.abs(close - close[length])
    float path = ta.sma(math.abs(ta.change(close)), length) * length
    na(path) or path == 0.0 ? 0.0 : f_clamp(net / path, 0.0, 1.0)

f_yn(bool ok) =>
    ok ? "YES" : "NO"

f_yn_bg(bool ok) =>
    ok ? color.new(C_LONG, 35) : color.new(C_SHORT, 40)

f_score_bg(float score, float gate) =>
    score >= gate + 8 ? color.new(C_LONG, 10) : score >= gate ? color.new(C_LONG, 40) : score >= gate - 8 ? color.new(C_WARN, 25) : color.new(#1e293b, 0)

f_conf_word(float score, float gate) =>
    score >= gate + 12 ? "HIGH" : score >= gate ? "READY" : score >= gate - 8 ? "NEAR" : "LOW"

f_nearest_above(float entry, float a, float b) =>
    float out = na
    if not na(a) and a > entry
        out := a
    if not na(b) and b > entry
        out := na(out) ? b : math.min(out, b)
    out

f_nearest_below(float entry, float a, float b) =>
    float out = na
    if not na(a) and a < entry
        out := a
    if not na(b) and b < entry
        out := na(out) ? b : math.max(out, b)
    out

// Drop levels that cannot be a nearby price (protects the chart scale).
f_near_price(float px, float a) =>
    float cap = math.max(close * 0.25, a * 16.0)
    na(px) or close <= 0.0 or na(a) or a <= 0.0 ? na : math.abs(px - close) > cap ? na : px

// Isolated USD-M approx, MMR 0.4%. 50x ~1.6%, 25x ~3.6% from entry.
f_short_liq(float entry, float lev) =>
    na(entry) ? na : entry * (1.0 + 1.0 / lev - 0.004)

f_long_liq(float entry, float lev) =>
    na(entry) ? na : entry * (1.0 - 1.0 / lev + 0.004)

f_near_n(float px, float a, float b, float c, float d, float e, float f, float band) =>
    int n = 0
    if not na(px) and band > 0.0
        if not na(a) and math.abs(a - px) <= band
            n += 1
        if not na(b) and math.abs(b - px) <= band
            n += 1
        if not na(c) and math.abs(c - px) <= band
            n += 1
        if not na(d) and math.abs(d - px) <= band
            n += 1
        if not na(e) and math.abs(e - px) <= band
            n += 1
        if not na(f) and math.abs(f - px) <= band
            n += 1
    n

f_trend(float px, float fast, float slow, float a, float fastExt, float slowExt) =>
    a > 0.0 ? f_clamp(0.50 * f_clamp((px - slow) / (slowExt * a), -1.0, 1.0) + 0.50 * f_clamp((fast - slow) / (fastExt * a), -1.0, 1.0), -1.0, 1.0) : 0.0

// Higher-timeframe ladder: smallest standard TF >= mult x chart, escalated
// until strictly above the chart TF. 15m -> 4x=60, 16x=240, 96x=D (V10 same).
f_htf(int mult) =>
    int csRaw = timeframe.in_seconds()
    int cs = na(csRaw) ? 900 : csRaw
    int t = cs * mult
    string tf = timeframe.from_seconds(t)
    if na(tf) or timeframe.in_seconds(tf) <= cs
        tf := timeframe.from_seconds(t + cs)
    if na(tf) or timeframe.in_seconds(tf) <= cs
        tf := timeframe.from_seconds(t + 2 * cs)
    if na(tf) or timeframe.in_seconds(tf) <= cs
        tf := timeframe.from_seconds(t + 4 * cs)
    if na(tf)
        tf := "D"
    tf

// AUTO PROFILE
string stdTicker = ticker.standard(syminfo.tickerid)
string tickerU = str.upper(syminfo.ticker)
bool isPerp = str.contains(tickerU, ".P")
bool isBtc = str.contains(tickerU, "BTC")
bool isMetal = str.contains(tickerU, "XAU") or str.contains(tickerU, "XAG") or str.contains(tickerU, "GOLD") or str.contains(tickerU, "SILVER") or str.contains(tickerU, "XPT") or str.contains(tickerU, "XPD")
bool typeCrypto = syminfo.type == "crypto" or isPerp
bool typeForex = syminfo.type == "forex"
bool typeFutures = syminfo.type == "futures"
bool typeIndex = syminfo.type == "index"
bool typeStock = syminfo.type == "stock" or syminfo.type == "dr" or syminfo.type == "fund" or syminfo.type == "cfd"
string profile = isBtc and typeCrypto ? "BTC" : typeCrypto ? "CRYPTO" : isMetal ? "METALS" : typeForex ? "FX" : typeIndex ? "INDEX" : typeStock ? "STOCKS" : typeFutures ? "FUTURES" : "GENERIC"
bool isBtcProf = profile == "BTC"
bool isCryptoProf = profile == "CRYPTO"
bool isMetalProf = profile == "METALS"
bool isFxProf = profile == "FX"
bool isIndexProf = profile == "INDEX"
bool isStockProf = profile == "STOCKS"
bool isFutProf = profile == "FUTURES" or profile == "GENERIC"
bool usesNySession = isStockProf or isIndexProf

// FX direction context: quoted-USD pairs (EURUSD) hurt by dollar strength;
// base-USD pairs (USDJPY) hurt by dollar weakness.
bool usdQuotePair = isFxProf and str.endswith(tickerU, "USD") and str.length(tickerU) == 6
bool usdBasePair = isFxProf and str.startswith(tickerU, "USD") and str.length(tickerU) == 6

// TIMEFRAME-ADAPTIVE WINDOWS (identical to V10 values on 15m)
// Non-time-based charts (renko/range/etc.) report na seconds — fall back to
// the 15m-equivalent profile rather than crashing the HTF requests.
int chartSecRaw = timeframe.in_seconds()
int chartSec = na(chartSecRaw) ? 900 : chartSecRaw
int fastLen = int(f_clamp(math.round(172800.0 / chartSec), 96, 768))    // ~48h in bars (15m -> 192)
int slowLen = int(f_clamp(math.round(604800.0 / chartSec), 192, 2016))  // ~7d in bars (15m -> 672)
int erLen = int(f_clamp(math.round(28800.0 / chartSec), 16, 64))        // ~8h in bars (15m -> 32)
string tfMid = f_htf(4)     // 15m -> "60"
string tfSlow = f_htf(16)   // 15m -> "240"
string tfMacro = f_htf(96)  // 15m -> "D"
bool macroOn = tfMacro != tfSlow and tfMacro != tfMid
bool useIntrabarDelta = showAdv ? useIntrabarDeltaIn : (not usesNySession) and timeframe.isminutes and timeframe.multiplier <= 240 and chartSec >= 900
string ltfStr = timeframe.from_seconds(math.max(60, int(chartSec / 15)))

if barstate.isfirst and lockBtc
    if stdTicker != "BINANCE:BTCUSDT.P"
        runtime.error("Lock: open BINANCE:BTCUSDT.P or turn the lock off.")
    if not (timeframe.isminutes and timeframe.multiplier == 15)
        runtime.error("Lock: switch the chart to 15m or turn the lock off.")

// PRICE FEATURES
float atr = ta.atr(14)
float atrPct = close > 0.0 ? atr / close * 100.0 : 0.0
float ema25 = ta.ema(close, 25)
float ema50 = ta.ema(close, 50)
float ema200 = ta.ema(close, 200)
float vwap = ta.vwap(hlc3)
float emaSlopeATR = atr > 0.0 ? (ema25 - ema25[4]) / atr : 0.0
float candleRange = math.max(high - low, syminfo.mintick)
float closeLocation = (close - low) / candleRange
float bodyFraction = math.abs(close - open) / candleRange
float extensionATR = atr > 0.0 ? math.abs(close - ema25) / atr : 999.0
float er32 = f_efficiency(erLen)
float rsi = ta.rsi(close, 14)
[diPlus, diMinus, adx] = ta.dmi(14, 14)
bool hasVolume = not na(volume) and volume > 0.0
float volumeRankRaw = f_rank(volume, fastLen)
float volumeRank = hasVolume ? volumeRankRaw : 50.0
float volRank = f_rank(atrPct, slowLen)

// CONFIRMED HTF (ladder adapts to chart; [1]+lookahead_on = last confirmed bar)
[h1Close, h1Ema25, h1Ema50, h1Atr, h1High, h1Low] = request.security(stdTicker, tfMid, [close[1], ta.ema(close, 25)[1], ta.ema(close, 50)[1], ta.atr(14)[1], ta.highest(high, 24)[1], ta.lowest(low, 24)[1]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
[h4Close, h4Ema50, h4Ema200, h4Atr, h4High, h4Low] = request.security(stdTicker, tfSlow, [close[1], ta.ema(close, 50)[1], ta.ema(close, 200)[1], ta.atr(14)[1], ta.highest(high, 18)[1], ta.lowest(low, 18)[1]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
[dClose, dEma50, dEma200, dAtr] = request.security(stdTicker, tfMacro, [close[1], ta.ema(close, 50)[1], ta.ema(close, 200)[1], ta.atr(14)[1]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)

bool h4Bull = h4Close > h4Ema50 and h4Ema50 > h4Ema200
bool h4Bear = h4Close < h4Ema50 and h4Ema50 < h4Ema200
bool h1Bull = h1Close > h1Ema50 and h1Ema25 > h1Ema50
bool h1Bear = h1Close < h1Ema50 and h1Ema25 < h1Ema50
bool dBull = macroOn and dClose > dEma50 and dEma50 > dEma200
bool dBear = macroOn and dClose < dEma50 and dEma50 < dEma200

float trend15 = f_trend(close, ema25, ema50, atr, 3.0, 3.0)
float trend1H = f_trend(h1Close, h1Ema25, h1Ema50, h1Atr, 2.0, 2.0)
float trend4H = f_trend(h4Close, h4Ema50, h4Ema200, h4Atr, 2.5, 3.0)
float trend1D = f_trend(dClose, dEma50, dEma200, dAtr, 2.5, 3.0)
float wMacro = macroOn ? 0.15 : 0.0
float mtfBias = f_clamp((0.15 * trend15 + 0.30 * trend1H + 0.40 * trend4H + wMacro * trend1D) / (0.85 + wMacro), -1.0, 1.0)

// DERIVATIVES (degrade to na when the venue has no feed)
float oiRaw = request.security(stdTicker + "_OI", timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
float frRaw = request.security(stdTicker + "_FR", timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
float lqBuyRaw = request.security(stdTicker + "_LQBUY", timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
float lqSellRaw = request.security(stdTicker + "_LQSELL", timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
float oi = useOi ? oiRaw : na
float funding = useFunding ? frRaw : na
bool oiOn = not na(oi)
bool frOn = not na(funding)
float oiPct = oiOn and oi[1] != 0.0 ? (oi / oi[1] - 1.0) * 100.0 : 0.0
float oiRankRaw = f_rank(math.abs(oiPct), fastLen)
float fundRankRaw = f_rank(nz(funding), slowLen)
float oiRank = oiOn ? oiRankRaw : 50.0
float fundRank = frOn ? fundRankRaw : 50.0
bool lqBuyOn = not na(lqBuyRaw)
bool lqSellOn = not na(lqSellRaw)
float lqBuyRankRaw = f_rank(nz(lqBuyRaw), fastLen)
float lqSellRankRaw = f_rank(nz(lqSellRaw), fastLen)
float lqBuyRank = lqBuyOn ? lqBuyRankRaw : 50.0
float lqSellRank = lqSellOn ? lqSellRankRaw : 50.0
bool actualShortLiq = lqBuyOn and lqBuyRank >= 85.0
bool actualLongLiq = lqSellOn and lqSellRank >= 85.0

// CROSS-ASSET (each profile reads only the feeds that exist for it)
[btcH1, btcH1Ema50] = request.security("BINANCE:BTCUSDT.P", "60", [close[1], ta.ema(close, 50)[1]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
[btcH4, btcH4Ema50, btcH4Ema200] = request.security("BINANCE:BTCUSDT.P", "240", [close[1], ta.ema(close, 50)[1], ta.ema(close, 200)[1]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
// 4-year-cycle anchor: BTC daily 50d/200d MA + position inside the rolling 4y range.
[btcDC, btcDS50, btcDS200, btcDLo4, btcDHi4] = request.security("BINANCE:BTCUSDT.P", "D", [close[1], ta.sma(close, 50)[1], ta.sma(close, 200)[1], ta.lowest(low, 1460)[1], ta.highest(high, 1460)[1]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
// own-chart daily cycle (used when the chart IS BTC)
[ownDC, ownDS50, ownDS200] = request.security(stdTicker, "D", [close[1], ta.sma(close, 50)[1], ta.sma(close, 200)[1]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
[btcDom, btcDomPrev] = request.security("CRYPTOCAP:BTC.D", "D", [close[1], close[2]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
[usdtDom, usdtDomPrev] = request.security("CRYPTOCAP:USDT.D", "D", [close[1], close[2]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
[dxyClose, dxyPrev, dxyEma50] = request.security("TVC:DXY", "D", [close[1], close[2], ta.ema(close, 50)[1]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
[vixClose, vixEma20] = request.security("CBOE:VIX", "D", [close[1], ta.ema(close, 20)[1]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
[spxClose, spxEma50, spxEma200] = request.security("TVC:SPX", "D", [close[1], ta.ema(close, 50)[1], ta.ema(close, 200)[1]], lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)

bool btcOn = useCrossAsset and not na(btcH4)
bool dxyOn = useCrossAsset and not na(dxyClose)
bool btcDomOn = useCrossAsset and not na(btcDom)
bool usdtOn = useCrossAsset and not na(usdtDom)
bool vixOn = useCrossAsset and not na(vixClose)
bool spxOn = useCrossAsset and not na(spxClose)
bool btcH1Bull = btcOn and btcH1 > btcH1Ema50
bool btcH1Bear = btcOn and btcH1 < btcH1Ema50
bool btcH4Bull = btcOn and btcH4 > btcH4Ema50 and btcH4Ema50 > btcH4Ema200
bool btcH4Bear = btcOn and btcH4 < btcH4Ema50 and btcH4Ema50 < btcH4Ema200
bool cycData = btcOn and not na(btcDS200)
bool btcCycBull = cycData and btcDC > btcDS200 and btcDC > btcDS50
bool btcCycBear = cycData and btcDC < btcDS200 and btcDC < btcDS50
float btcPos4y = cycData and btcDHi4 > btcDLo4 ? (btcDC - btcDLo4) / (btcDHi4 - btcDLo4) : 0.5
bool ownCycData = not na(ownDS200)
bool ownCycBull = ownCycData and ownDC > ownDS200 and ownDC > ownDS50
bool ownCycBear = ownCycData and ownDC < ownDS200 and ownDC < ownDS50
bool dxyRiskOff = dxyOn and dxyClose > dxyEma50 and dxyClose > dxyPrev
bool dxyWeak = dxyOn and dxyClose < dxyEma50 and dxyClose < dxyPrev
bool usdtRiskOff = usdtOn and usdtDom > usdtDomPrev
bool vixStress = vixOn and vixClose > vixEma20 and vixClose >= 22.0
bool spxBull = spxOn and spxClose > spxEma50 and spxEma50 > spxEma200
bool spxBear = spxOn and spxClose < spxEma50 and spxEma50 < spxEma200

float earnPrint = request.earnings(stdTicker, earnings.actual, barmerge.gaps_on, barmerge.lookahead_off, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
bool earnBar = isStockProf and not na(earnPrint)
int barsPerSession = timeframe.isminutes ? int(math.max(1, math.round((usesNySession ? 6.5 : 24.0) * 60.0 / timeframe.multiplier))) : 1
int earnAgo = ta.barssince(earnBar)
bool earningsBlocked = isStockProf and earningsBlackoutDays > 0 and not na(earnAgo) and earnAgo <= math.max(1, earningsBlackoutDays * barsPerSession)
int nyMin = hour(time, "America/New_York") * 60 + minute(time, "America/New_York")
bool stocksSession = not usesNySession or (nyMin >= 9 * 60 + 30 + skipOpenMinutes and nyMin <= 16 * 60 - skipCloseMinutes)

// INTRABAR DELTA (lower TF = chart/15; 15m -> 1m)
array<float> ltfOpen = request.security_lower_tf(stdTicker, ltfStr, open, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, ignore_invalid_timeframe=true)
array<float> ltfClose = request.security_lower_tf(stdTicker, ltfStr, close, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, ignore_invalid_timeframe=true)
array<float> ltfVol = request.security_lower_tf(stdTicker, ltfStr, volume, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, ignore_invalid_timeframe=true)
float deltaPct = 0.0
bool deltaOn = false
if useIntrabarDelta
    float dlt = 0.0
    float tot = 0.0
    int n = math.min(array.size(ltfOpen), math.min(array.size(ltfClose), array.size(ltfVol)))
    if n > 0
        for i = 0 to n - 1
            tot += array.get(ltfVol, i)
            float ic = array.get(ltfClose, i)
            float io = array.get(ltfOpen, i)
            dlt += ic > io ? array.get(ltfVol, i) : ic < io ? -array.get(ltfVol, i) : 0.0
    deltaOn := tot > 0.0
    deltaPct := deltaOn ? dlt / tot * 100.0 : 0.0

// SMC: confirmed swings only. CONTEXT layer — paints structure, feeds the
// score bonus, but cannot open a trade alone (measured PF ~0.2 as entries).
int SW = 5
float ph = ta.pivothigh(high, SW, SW)
float pl = ta.pivotlow(low, SW, SW)

var float lastPH = na
var float prevPH = na
var int lastPHBar = na
var float lastPL = na
var float prevPL = na
var int lastPLBar = na
var float lastPHDone = na
var float lastPLDone = na
var int bosBar = na
var int bosDir = 0
var float fvgTop = na
var float fvgBot = na
var int fvgDir = 0
var int fvgBar = na
var float obTop = na
var float obBot = na
var int obDir = 0
var int obBar = na
var int longSweepBar = na
var int shortSweepBar = na

if not na(ph)
    prevPH := lastPH
    lastPH := ph
    lastPHBar := bar_index - SW
if not na(pl)
    prevPL := lastPL
    lastPL := pl
    lastPLBar := bar_index - SW

bool sweepLow = not na(lastPL) and low < lastPL and close > lastPL and closeLocation >= 0.55 and volumeRank >= 55.0
bool sweepHigh = not na(lastPH) and high > lastPH and close < lastPH and closeLocation <= 0.45 and volumeRank >= 55.0
if sweepLow
    longSweepBar := bar_index
    shortSweepBar := na
if sweepHigh
    shortSweepBar := bar_index
    longSweepBar := na
bool longSweepDone = not na(longSweepBar) and bar_index - longSweepBar <= 48
bool shortSweepDone = not na(shortSweepBar) and bar_index - shortSweepBar <= 48

bool bosUp = not na(lastPH) and close > lastPH and close[1] <= lastPH and (na(lastPHDone) or lastPHDone != lastPH)
bool bosDn = not na(lastPL) and close < lastPL and close[1] >= lastPL and (na(lastPLDone) or lastPLDone != lastPL)
if bosUp
    bosBar := bar_index
    bosDir := 1
    lastPHDone := lastPH
    int found = 1
    for i = 1 to 8
        if close[i] < open[i]
            found := i
            break
    obTop := math.max(open[found], close[found])
    obBot := low[found]
    obDir := 1
    obBar := bar_index - found
if bosDn
    bosBar := bar_index
    bosDir := -1
    lastPLDone := lastPL
    int foundDn = 1
    for i = 1 to 8
        if close[i] > open[i]
            foundDn := i
            break
    obTop := high[foundDn]
    obBot := math.min(open[foundDn], close[foundDn])
    obDir := -1
    obBar := bar_index - foundDn

float midBody = math.abs(close[1] - open[1]) / math.max(high[1] - low[1], syminfo.mintick)
bool fvgUp = low > high[2] and midBody >= 0.45
bool fvgDn = high < low[2] and midBody >= 0.45
if fvgUp
    fvgTop := low
    fvgBot := high[2]
    fvgDir := 1
    fvgBar := bar_index
if fvgDn
    fvgTop := low[2]
    fvgBot := high
    fvgDir := -1
    fvgBar := bar_index

bool inBullOB = obDir == 1 and not na(obTop) and not na(obBot) and not na(obBar) and bar_index > obBar and low <= obTop and high >= obBot and close >= obBot
bool inBearOB = obDir == -1 and not na(obTop) and not na(obBot) and not na(obBar) and bar_index > obBar and high >= obBot and low <= obTop and close <= obTop
bool inBullFVG = fvgDir == 1 and not na(fvgTop) and not na(fvgBot) and not na(fvgBar) and bar_index > fvgBar and low <= fvgTop and high >= fvgBot and close >= fvgBot
bool inBearFVG = fvgDir == -1 and not na(fvgTop) and not na(fvgBot) and not na(fvgBar) and bar_index > fvgBar and high >= fvgBot and low <= fvgTop and close <= fvgTop
bool recentBOS = not na(bosBar) and bar_index - bosBar <= 32
bool bosAfterLongSweep = longSweepDone and not na(bosBar) and not na(longSweepBar) and bosBar >= longSweepBar
bool bosAfterShortSweep = shortSweepDone and not na(bosBar) and not na(shortSweepBar) and bosBar >= shortSweepBar
bool bullConfluence = (bosAfterLongSweep and bosDir == 1 and (inBullOB or inBullFVG)) or (inBullOB and recentBOS and bosDir == 1)
bool bearConfluence = (bosAfterShortSweep and bosDir == -1 and (inBearOB or inBearFVG)) or (inBearOB and recentBOS and bosDir == -1)

if not na(obBar) and bar_index > obBar and (bar_index - obBar > 48 or (obDir == 1 and close < obBot) or (obDir == -1 and close > obTop))
    obTop := na
    obBot := na
    obDir := 0
    obBar := na
if not na(fvgBar) and bar_index > fvgBar and (bar_index - fvgBar > 48 or (fvgDir == 1 and low <= fvgBot) or (fvgDir == -1 and high >= fvgTop))
    fvgTop := na
    fvgBot := na
    fvgDir := 0
    fvgBar := na

// LIQUIDATION MAP (proxy, not Coinglass). Perps/crypto only. Levels are prices,
// so they render as boxes on the chart — never as a plotted series. Logic uses
// liqAvail so the display toggle can never change signal output.
bool liqAvail = isPerp or isBtcProf or isCryptoProf
bool showLiqMap = showStructure and liqAvail
float sh50 = f_short_liq(lastPH, 50.0)
float sh25 = f_short_liq(lastPH, 25.0)
float sh50b = f_short_liq(prevPH, 50.0)
float sh25b = f_short_liq(prevPH, 25.0)
float shH1 = f_short_liq(h1High, 50.0)
float shH4 = f_short_liq(h4High, 25.0)
float lg50 = f_long_liq(lastPL, 50.0)
float lg25 = f_long_liq(lastPL, 25.0)
float lg50b = f_long_liq(prevPL, 50.0)
float lg25b = f_long_liq(prevPL, 25.0)
float lgH1 = f_long_liq(h1Low, 50.0)
float lgH4 = f_long_liq(h4Low, 25.0)
float shortMagnet = f_nearest_above(close, sh50, sh25)
shortMagnet := f_nearest_above(close, shortMagnet, sh50b)
shortMagnet := f_nearest_above(close, shortMagnet, sh25b)
shortMagnet := f_nearest_above(close, shortMagnet, shH1)
shortMagnet := f_nearest_above(close, shortMagnet, shH4)
shortMagnet := f_nearest_above(close, shortMagnet, lastPH)
shortMagnet := f_near_price(shortMagnet, atr)
float longMagnet = f_nearest_below(close, lg50, lg25)
longMagnet := f_nearest_below(close, longMagnet, lg50b)
longMagnet := f_nearest_below(close, longMagnet, lg25b)
longMagnet := f_nearest_below(close, longMagnet, lgH1)
longMagnet := f_nearest_below(close, longMagnet, lgH4)
longMagnet := f_nearest_below(close, longMagnet, lastPL)
longMagnet := f_near_price(longMagnet, atr)
float liqBand = atr * 0.35
int shortLiqDens = f_near_n(shortMagnet, lastPH, sh50, sh25, sh50b, sh25b, shH4, liqBand)
int longLiqDens = f_near_n(longMagnet, lastPL, lg50, lg25, lg50b, lg25b, lgH4, liqBand)
float shortLiqDist = atr > 0.0 and not na(shortMagnet) ? (shortMagnet - close) / atr : na
float longLiqDist = atr > 0.0 and not na(longMagnet) ? (close - longMagnet) / atr : na
bool shortLiqInPlay = liqAvail and not na(shortLiqDist) and shortLiqDist >= 0.35 and shortLiqDist <= 4.0
bool longLiqInPlay = liqAvail and not na(longLiqDist) and longLiqDist >= 0.35 and longLiqDist <= 4.0
bool bullLiqFuel = shortLiqInPlay and (shortLiqDens >= 2 or oiRank >= 70.0 or actualShortLiq)
bool bearLiqFuel = longLiqInPlay and (longLiqDens >= 2 or oiRank >= 70.0 or actualLongLiq)
bool longIntoLiq = liqAvail and not na(longLiqDist) and longLiqDist <= 0.55 and longLiqDens >= 2
bool shortIntoLiq = liqAvail and not na(shortLiqDist) and shortLiqDist <= 0.55 and shortLiqDens >= 2
// Trap state (cascade fingerprint): crowded positioning + OI extreme + a
// liquidation pool sitting close AGAINST the intended direction.
bool longTrap = liqAvail and frOn and fundRank >= 90.0 and oiRank >= 80.0 and not na(longLiqDist) and longLiqDist <= 1.5 and longLiqDens >= 2
bool shortTrap = liqAvail and frOn and fundRank <= 10.0 and oiRank >= 80.0 and not na(shortLiqDist) and shortLiqDist <= 1.5 and shortLiqDens >= 2
float liqLongBoost = (bullLiqFuel ? 2.0 : 0.0) + (shortLiqInPlay and shortLiqDens >= 2 ? 2.0 : 0.0) + (actualShortLiq ? 2.0 : 0.0) - (longIntoLiq ? 3.0 : 0.0) - (longTrap ? 6.0 : 0.0)
float liqShortBoost = (bearLiqFuel ? 2.0 : 0.0) + (longLiqInPlay and longLiqDens >= 2 ? 2.0 : 0.0) + (actualLongLiq ? 2.0 : 0.0) - (shortIntoLiq ? 3.0 : 0.0) - (shortTrap ? 6.0 : 0.0)
float liqFuel = liqAvail ? 1.0 * shortLiqDens - 1.0 * longLiqDens : 0.0

// TTM SQUEEZE: BB inside KC = compression. Fire = first bar it ends.
float bbBasis = ta.sma(close, 20)
float bbDev = 2.0 * ta.stdev(close, 20)
float kcBasis = ta.ema(close, 20)
float kcDev = 1.5 * ta.atr(20)
bool squeezeOn = (bbBasis + bbDev) < (kcBasis + kcDev) and (bbBasis - bbDev) > (kcBasis - kcDev)
bool squeezeFire = squeezeOn[1] and not squeezeOn
int barsSinceSqueezeOff = ta.barssince(not squeezeOn)
int squeezeBars = squeezeOn ? nz(barsSinceSqueezeOff, 0) : 0
float squeezeMom = ta.linreg(close - math.avg(math.avg(ta.highest(high, 20), ta.lowest(low, 20)), ta.sma(close, 20)), 20, 0)
int squeezeHeld = nz(barsSinceSqueezeOff[1], 0)
var int squeezeFireBar = na
var int squeezeFireDir = 0
if squeezeFire and squeezeHeld >= 5
    squeezeFireBar := bar_index
    squeezeFireDir := squeezeMom >= 0 ? 1 : -1
bool expansionLive = not squeezeOn and not na(squeezeFireBar) and bar_index - squeezeFireBar <= 16
bool longVol = expansionLive and squeezeFireDir == 1 and squeezeMom >= 0
bool shortVol = expansionLive and squeezeFireDir == -1 and squeezeMom <= 0

// SIGNAL LAYERS
bool longRegime = h4Bull and h1Bull
bool shortRegime = h4Bear and h1Bear
bool chopVeto = adx < minAdx and er32 < minER
bool volSpikeVeto = volRank >= 97.0
bool deadVolVeto = volRank <= 8.0 and adx < 12.0
bool volGate = not hasVolume or volumeRank >= (isCryptoProf ? math.max(minVolumeRank, 55.0) : usesNySession ? math.max(minVolumeRank, 45.0) : minVolumeRank)
bool longFlowOK = (not oiOn or oiPct >= -0.15) and (not frOn or fundRank <= 92.0)
bool shortFlowOK = (not oiOn or oiPct >= -0.15) and (not frOn or fundRank >= 8.0)
bool longX = true
bool shortX = true
bool anchorLong = btcAnchor == "4Y Cycle" ? btcCycBull : btcAnchor == "Cycle+Trend" ? btcCycBull and btcH4Bull and btcH1Bull : btcAnchor == "Off" ? true : btcH4Bull and btcH1Bull
bool anchorShort = btcAnchor == "4Y Cycle" ? btcCycBear : btcAnchor == "Cycle+Trend" ? btcCycBear and btcH4Bear and btcH1Bear : btcAnchor == "Off" ? true : btcH4Bear and btcH1Bear
bool ownAnchorLong = btcAnchor == "4Y Cycle" ? (not ownCycData or ownCycBull) : btcAnchor == "Cycle+Trend" ? (not ownCycData or ownCycBull) and h4Bull : btcAnchor == "Off" ? true : h4Bull
bool ownAnchorShort = btcAnchor == "4Y Cycle" ? (not ownCycData or ownCycBear) : btcAnchor == "Cycle+Trend" ? (not ownCycData or ownCycBear) and h4Bear : btcAnchor == "Off" ? true : h4Bear
if isBtcProf
    longX := ownAnchorLong and not (dxyRiskOff and usdtRiskOff)
    shortX := ownAnchorShort and not (dxyOn and dxyWeak and usdtOn and usdtDom < usdtDomPrev)
else if isCryptoProf
    longX := (not btcOn or anchorLong) and not usdtRiskOff
    shortX := not btcOn or anchorShort
else if isFxProf
    longX := not dxyOn or (usdQuotePair ? not dxyRiskOff : usdBasePair ? not dxyWeak : true)
    shortX := not dxyOn or (usdQuotePair ? not dxyWeak : usdBasePair ? not dxyRiskOff : true)
else if isMetalProf
    longX := not dxyRiskOff
    shortX := not dxyWeak
else if usesNySession
    longX := not vixStress and (not spxOn or spxBull) and stocksSession and (not isStockProf or (close >= vwap and not earningsBlocked))
    shortX := (not spxOn or spxBear) and (not vixOn or vixClose > vixEma20) and stocksSession and (not isStockProf or (close <= vwap and not earningsBlocked))
else
    longX := not vixStress
    shortX := not vixStress

bool longReclaim = ema25 > ema50 and emaSlopeATR > minSlopeATR and low <= ema25 and close > ema25 and close[1] <= ema25[1] and close > open and closeLocation >= minCloseLocation and bodyFraction >= minBodyFraction and extensionATR <= 1.0
bool shortReject = ema25 < ema50 and emaSlopeATR < -minSlopeATR and high >= ema25 and close < ema25 and close[1] >= ema25[1] and close < open and closeLocation <= 1.0 - minCloseLocation and bodyFraction >= minBodyFraction and extensionATR <= 1.0

// V12 second family: multi-bar pullback -> resume. EMA25 tapped within the
// last pbWin bars (wick or body), depth under pbDeepMax ATR, then a quality
// resume bar. Ride volume is softer by design (dips contract volume).
int pbBarsL = nz(ta.barssince(low <= ema25), 100000)
int pbBarsS = nz(ta.barssince(high >= ema25), 100000)
float pbDeepL = ema25 - ta.lowest(low, pbWin + 1)
float pbDeepS = ta.highest(high, pbWin + 1) - ema25
bool longPbRes = ema25 > ema50 and emaSlopeATR > minSlopeATR and pbBarsL <= pbWin and not na(pbDeepL) and pbDeepL <= pbDeepMax * atr and close > ema25 and close > open and closeLocation >= minCloseLocation and bodyFraction >= minBodyFraction and extensionATR <= 1.0
bool shortPbRes = ema25 < ema50 and emaSlopeATR < -minSlopeATR and pbBarsS <= pbWin and not na(pbDeepS) and pbDeepS <= pbDeepMax * atr and close < ema25 and close < open and closeLocation <= 1.0 - minCloseLocation and bodyFraction >= minBodyFraction and extensionATR <= 1.0
bool volGateL = longReclaim ? volGate : (not hasVolume or volumeRank >= pbVolGate)
bool volGateS = shortReject ? volGate : (not hasVolume or volumeRank >= pbVolGate)
bool longTrig = longReclaim or longPbRes
bool shortTrig = shortReject or shortPbRes

bool liveSession = usesNySession ? stocksSession : true
float dollarFlow = ta.median(close * nz(volume, 0.0), 96) / math.max(1, chartSec)
float liqFloor = chartSec < 3600 ? math.max(minDollarFlow, 600.0) : minDollarFlow
bool liqOK = not hasVolume or na(dollarFlow) or dollarFlow >= liqFloor
bool longRaw = longRegime and longTrig and volGateL and not chopVeto and not volSpikeVeto and not deadVolVeto and rsi < 76.0 and diPlus >= diMinus and longFlowOK and longX and liveSession and liqOK and volRank >= vlFloor
bool shortRaw = shortRegime and shortTrig and volGateS and not chopVeto and not volSpikeVeto and not deadVolVeto and rsi > 24.0 and diMinus >= diPlus and shortFlowOK and shortX and liveSession and liqOK and volRank >= vlFloor
bool anyRaw = longRaw or shortRaw

// SCORE
f_dir_score(bool isLong, float trapPen) =>
    float htf = isLong ? f_clamp(mtfBias, 0.0, 1.0) : f_clamp(-mtfBias, 0.0, 1.0)
    float trendQ = f_clamp((adx - 10.0) / 30.0, 0.0, 1.0) * 0.55 + f_clamp(er32 / 0.45, 0.0, 1.0) * 0.45
    float loc = isLong ? closeLocation : 1.0 - closeLocation
    float setupQ = 0.40 * f_clamp((loc - 0.50) / 0.50, 0.0, 1.0) + 0.30 * f_clamp(bodyFraction / 0.70, 0.0, 1.0) + 0.30 * f_clamp(volumeRank / 100.0, 0.0, 1.0)
    float flow = 0.50
    if oiOn
        flow := oiPct > 0.0 ? 0.50 + 0.50 * (oiRank / 100.0) : 0.35
    if deltaOn
        float aligned = isLong ? math.max(deltaPct, 0.0) : math.max(-deltaPct, 0.0)
        flow := 0.60 * flow + 0.40 * f_clamp(aligned / 40.0, 0.0, 1.0)
    if frOn
        float crowd = isLong ? (100.0 - fundRank) / 100.0 : fundRank / 100.0
        flow := 0.75 * flow + 0.25 * crowd
    float x = 0.60
    if isBtcProf
        x := 0.40 + (dxyRiskOff ? 0.0 : 0.20) + (usdtRiskOff ? 0.0 : 0.20) + (btcDomOn and btcDom >= btcDomPrev ? 0.20 : 0.10)
    else if isCryptoProf
        x := 0.25 + (btcH4Bull ? 0.30 : btcH1Bull ? 0.15 : 0.0) + (usdtRiskOff ? 0.0 : 0.20) + 0.25
    else if isFxProf
        bool aligned = usdQuotePair ? (isLong ? dxyWeak : dxyRiskOff) : usdBasePair ? (isLong ? dxyRiskOff : dxyWeak) : false
        x := 0.55 + (aligned ? 0.20 : not dxyOn ? 0.10 : 0.0)
    else if isMetalProf
        x := 0.55 + ((isLong and dxyWeak) or (not isLong and dxyRiskOff) ? 0.20 : not dxyOn ? 0.10 : 0.0)
    else if usesNySession
        x := 0.25 + ((spxBull and isLong) or (spxBear and not isLong) ? 0.30 : 0.10) + (vixStress and isLong ? 0.0 : 0.25) + 0.20
    float smc = isLong ? (longSweepDone ? 0.20 : 0.0) + (recentBOS and bosDir == 1 ? 0.40 : 0.0) + (inBullOB or inBullFVG ? 0.40 : 0.0) : (shortSweepDone ? 0.20 : 0.0) + (recentBOS and bosDir == -1 ? 0.40 : 0.0) + (inBearOB or inBearFVG ? 0.40 : 0.0)
    float volFit = volRank >= 20.0 and volRank <= 90.0 ? 1.0 : 0.45
    float core = 0.26 * htf + 0.20 * trendQ + 0.20 * setupQ + 0.16 * flow + 0.14 * x + 0.04 * volFit
    f_clamp(100.0 * core + 6.0 * smc + (isLong ? (longVol ? 8.0 : 0.0) : (shortVol ? 8.0 : 0.0)) + (isLong ? liqLongBoost : liqShortBoost) - trapPen, 0.0, 100.0)

float longScore = f_dir_score(true, longTrap ? 6.0 : 0.0)
float shortScore = f_dir_score(false, shortTrap ? 6.0 : 0.0)

// Churn thermostat: repeated raw setups in 64 bars = churn, raise the gate.
float cumRaw = ta.cum(anyRaw ? 1.0 : 0.0)
int churnN = int(cumRaw - nz(cumRaw[64], 0.0))
float adaptiveGate = f_clamp(baseScoreGate + (isCryptoProf ? 8.0 : 0.0) + (chopVeto ? 8.0 : 0.0) - 6.0 * er32 + math.max(0, churnN - 6) * 0.75, 58.0, 86.0)

var int lastSignalBar = na
// V5 lesson: cooldown stretches in inefficient tape, relaxes in trends;
// V11 adds a loss-streak stretch (circuit breaker, max +6).
var int lossStreak = 0
int cooldownEff = int(math.max(cooldownBars, math.round(10.0 - 5.0 * er32))) + math.min(lossStreak, 3) * 2
bool cooldownOK = na(lastSignalBar) or bar_index - lastSignalBar > cooldownEff
var bool tradeActive = false
var int pendDir = 0
var bool pendRange = false
var bool tradeRange = false

// SELF-CALIBRATION: closed sim trades on this chart teach the exits and the
// direction veto. All stats update only when a trade closes — no lookahead.
var array<float> statMfeR = array.new<float>()
var array<float> statRealR = array.new<float>()
var array<float> statRealL = array.new<float>()
var array<float> statRealS = array.new<float>()
var array<float> statDur = array.new<float>()
var array<float> statTp1Dur = array.new<float>()
var array<float> statTp1Win = array.new<float>()
var array<float> statMaeWin = array.new<float>()  // winners' adverse excursion, in ATR
var array<float> statMfeLose = array.new<float>() // losers' favorable excursion, in R
int statN = array.size(statMfeR)
float mfeQ35 = na
float mfeQ60 = na
float mfeQ80 = na
if statN >= 10
    array<float> srt = array.copy(statMfeR)
    array.sort(srt, order.ascending)
    mfeQ35 := array.percentile_linear_interpolation(srt, 35)
    mfeQ60 := array.percentile_linear_interpolation(srt, 60)
    mfeQ80 := array.percentile_linear_interpolation(srt, 80)
float shrinkW = f_clamp(statN / 40.0, 0.0, 0.65)
float medDur = statN >= 10 ? array.median(statDur) : na
float medTp1 = array.size(statTp1Dur) >= 8 ? array.median(statTp1Dur) : na
int defaultValid = int(math.round(f_clamp(effHoldBars / 8.0, 4.0, 12.0)))
int validBars = na(medTp1) ? defaultValid : int(math.round(f_clamp(medTp1 * 1.5, 3.0, 24.0)))

// Learned stop: q85 of winners' MAE (ATR) x1.25 headroom, half-weight cap.
float learnedStopATR = na
float stopW = 0.0
if array.size(statMaeWin) >= 8
    array<float> maeSrt = array.copy(statMaeWin)
    array.sort(maeSrt, order.ascending)
    float maeQ85 = array.percentile_linear_interpolation(maeSrt, 85)
    learnedStopATR := f_clamp(maeQ85 * 1.25, 0.9, 2.8)
    stopW := f_clamp(array.size(statMaeWin) / 24.0, 0.0, 0.50)
// Give-back: losers regularly reaching deep open profit -> tighten the trail.
float loseMfeMed = array.size(statMfeLose) >= 8 ? array.median(statMfeLose) : na

// Direction self-veto: a side proves itself or gets switched off.
int nL = array.size(statRealL)
int nS = array.size(statRealS)
bool dirLongLearnedOff = useDirLearn and nL >= 6 and array.avg(statRealL) < -0.15
bool dirShortLearnedOff = useDirLearn and nS >= 6 and array.avg(statRealS) < -0.15
bool dirLongOK = allowLong and not dirLongLearnedOff
bool dirShortOK = allowShort and not dirShortLearnedOff

// RISK / TARGETS
float effStopATR = chartSec >= 3600 ? math.max(stopATR, 2.6) : stopATR
float baseStopATR = effStopATR + 0.20 * (volRank / 100.0)
float adaptiveStopATR = f_blend(baseStopATR, learnedStopATR, stopW)
float longStopPx = close - atr * adaptiveStopATR
float shortStopPx = close + atr * adaptiveStopATR
float longRisk = close - longStopPx
float shortRisk = shortStopPx - close
// Room is an entry-eligibility check: measure it against the BASE stop so
// learned exit state can never loosen admission (contract: self-cal = exits).
float longObstacle = f_nearest_above(close, h1High, h4High)
float shortObstacle = f_nearest_below(close, h1Low, h4Low)
float baseRisk = atr * baseStopATR
float longRoomR = baseRisk > 0.0 ? (na(longObstacle) ? 99.0 : (longObstacle - close) / baseRisk) : 0.0
float shortRoomR = baseRisk > 0.0 ? (na(shortObstacle) ? 99.0 : (close - shortObstacle) / baseRisk) : 0.0
bool longRoomOK = longRoomR >= roomMinR
bool shortRoomOK = shortRoomR >= roomMinR

float longAmb = f_clamp(0.50 * (longScore / 100.0) + 0.30 * f_clamp(mtfBias, 0.0, 1.0) + 0.20 * er32, 0.0, 1.0)
float shortAmb = f_clamp(0.50 * (shortScore / 100.0) + 0.30 * f_clamp(-mtfBias, 0.0, 1.0) + 0.20 * er32, 0.0, 1.0)
// TP tiers: V7 prior blended toward this chart's own MFE quantiles.
float longT1m = f_clamp(learnTargets ? f_blend(tp1Base + 0.30 * longAmb, mfeQ35, shrinkW) : tp1Base + 0.30 * longAmb, 0.50, 1.60) * lTpM
float shortT1m = f_clamp(learnTargets ? f_blend(tp1Base + 0.30 * shortAmb, mfeQ35, shrinkW) : tp1Base + 0.30 * shortAmb, 0.50, 1.60) * sTpM
float longR = f_clamp(learnTargets ? f_blend(effTargetR + 0.60 * longAmb, mfeQ60, shrinkW) : effTargetR + 0.60 * longAmb, longT1m + 0.30, 4.50) * lTpM
float shortR = f_clamp(learnTargets ? f_blend(effTargetR + 0.60 * shortAmb, mfeQ60, shrinkW) : effTargetR + 0.60 * shortAmb, shortT1m + 0.30, 4.50) * sTpM
float longT3m = f_clamp(learnTargets ? f_blend(longR + 1.10 + 0.80 * longAmb, mfeQ80, shrinkW) : longR + 1.10 + 0.80 * longAmb, longR + 0.40, 7.00) * lTpM
float shortT3m = f_clamp(learnTargets ? f_blend(shortR + 1.10 + 0.80 * shortAmb, mfeQ80, shrinkW) : shortR + 1.10 + 0.80 * shortAmb, shortR + 0.40, 7.00) * sTpM
// TP3 smart cap: exit before the liquidity wall, not through it.
if tpSmart and not na(longObstacle) and longRisk > 0.0
    float smartM = (longObstacle - atr * 0.10 - close) / longRisk
    if smartM > 1.30 and smartM < longT3m
        longT3m := smartM
if tpSmart and not na(shortObstacle) and shortRisk > 0.0
    float smartM2 = (close - atr * 0.10 - shortObstacle) / shortRisk
    if smartM2 > 1.30 and smartM2 < shortT3m
        shortT3m := smartM2
float longTP1p = close + longRisk * longT1m
float longTP2p = close + longRisk * longR
float longTP3p = close + longRisk * longT3m
if not na(longObstacle) and longObstacle < longTP2p and longObstacle > close
    longTP2p := math.max(close + longRisk * 0.90, longObstacle - atr * 0.08)
longTP2p := math.max(longTP2p, longTP1p + longRisk * 0.10)  // keep TP2 above TP1
float shortTP1p = close - shortRisk * shortT1m
float shortTP2p = close - shortRisk * shortR
float shortTP3p = close - shortRisk * shortT3m
if not na(shortObstacle) and shortObstacle > shortTP2p and shortObstacle < close
    shortTP2p := math.min(close - shortRisk * 0.90, shortObstacle + atr * 0.08)
shortTP2p := math.min(shortTP2p, shortTP1p - shortRisk * 0.10)
int previewDir = longRegime and not shortRegime ? 1 : shortRegime and not longRegime ? -1 : longScore >= shortScore ? 1 : -1
float previewR = previewDir == 1 ? longR : shortR
float previewSL = previewDir == 1 ? longStopPx : shortStopPx
float previewTP1 = previewDir == 1 ? longTP1p : shortTP1p
float previewTP2 = previewDir == 1 ? longTP2p : shortTP2p
float previewTP3 = previewDir == 1 ? longTP3p : shortTP3p

// SIGNALS (confirmed close). The signal bar marks intent; the sim fills at
// the NEXT bar open plus slippage, or skips on gap-through.
bool rangeLong = false
bool rangeShort = false
if rgMode and chartSec >= 3600 and barstate.isconfirmed and not tradeActive and pendDir == 0 and cooldownOK and liqOK and liveSession
    if adx < rgAdxHi and adx >= rgAdxLo and er32 < 0.15 and volRank >= rgVolrMin
        float devA = (ema50 - close) / atr
        if devA >= rgExt and rsi <= 32.0 and closeLocation <= 0.30 and rgDirs != "Short only" and (rgCycle != "Aligned" or not btcCycBear)
            rangeLong := true
        else if devA <= -rgExt and rsi >= 68.0 and closeLocation >= 0.70 and rgDirs != "Long only" and (rgCycle != "Aligned" or not btcCycBull)
            rangeShort := true
        if rgCycle == "No bull fades" and btcCycBull
            rangeLong := false
            rangeShort := false
bool pendFree = pendDir == 0 or pendRange
bool longSignal = (barstate.isconfirmed and not tradeActive and pendFree and cooldownOK and dirLongOK and longRaw and longScore >= adaptiveGate and longRoomOK and (not shortRaw or longScore >= shortScore)) or (rgMode and rangeLong)
bool shortSignal = ((barstate.isconfirmed and not tradeActive and pendFree and cooldownOK and dirShortOK and shortRaw and shortScore >= adaptiveGate and shortRoomOK) or (rgMode and rangeShort)) and not longSignal
if longSignal or shortSignal
    lastSignalBar := bar_index

// WHY / WAIT
string waitReason = "WAIT"
if tradeActive
    waitReason := "IN TRADE"
else if pendDir != 0
    waitReason := "PENDING FILL"
else if not cooldownOK
    waitReason := "COOLDOWN"
else if chopVeto
    waitReason := "CHOP"
else if volSpikeVeto
    waitReason := "VOL SPIKE"
else if deadVolVeto
    waitReason := "DEAD VOL"
else if not longRegime and not shortRegime
    waitReason := "NO HTF TREND"
else if dirLongLearnedOff and dirShortLearnedOff
    waitReason := "BOTH SIDES LEARNED OFF"
else if longRegime and dirLongLearnedOff
    waitReason := "LONG LEARNED OFF"
else if shortRegime and dirShortLearnedOff
    waitReason := "SHORT LEARNED OFF"
else if longRegime and not longTrig
    waitReason := longSweepDone and not recentBOS ? "SWEEP, WAIT BOS" : "WAIT RECLAIM"
else if shortRegime and not shortTrig
    waitReason := shortSweepDone and not recentBOS ? "SWEEP, WAIT BOS" : "WAIT REJECT"
else if longRaw and dirLongOK and (longScore < adaptiveGate or not longRoomOK)
    waitReason := not longRoomOK ? "NO ROOM" : "LONG SCORE LOW"
else if shortRaw and dirShortOK and (shortScore < adaptiveGate or not shortRoomOK)
    waitReason := not shortRoomOK ? "NO ROOM" : "SHORT SCORE LOW"

string dayTxt = not macroOn ? "MACRO n/a" : dBull ? "D BULL" : dBear ? "D BEAR" : "D MIX"
string mtfTxt = mtfBias >= 0.45 ? "STRONG BULL" : mtfBias >= 0.12 ? "BULL" : mtfBias <= -0.45 ? "STRONG BEAR" : mtfBias <= -0.12 ? "BEAR" : "RANGE"
string smcTxt = (longSweepDone ? "SWEEP LOW -> " : shortSweepDone ? "SWEEP HIGH -> " : "") + (recentBOS ? (bosDir == 1 ? "BOS UP" : "BOS DN") : "no BOS")
string flowTxt = (oiOn ? (oiPct > 0 ? "OI +" : "OI -") : "OI n/a") + "  " + (deltaOn ? (deltaPct > 0 ? "Δ +" : "Δ -") : "Δ n/a") + "  " + (frOn ? (fundRank >= 90 ? "crowd long" : fundRank <= 10 ? "crowd short" : "FR mid") : "FR n/a")
string liqTxt = not liqAvail ? "LIQ n/a" : longTrap ? "TRAP↓ longs crowded" : shortTrap ? "TRAP↑ shorts crowded" : actualShortLiq ? "LIQ BUY SPIKE" : actualLongLiq ? "LIQ SELL SPIKE" : bullLiqFuel ? "LIQ↑ fuel" : bearLiqFuel ? "LIQ↓ fuel" : "LIQ quiet"
string longWhy = (longRegime ? "HTF bull" : "HTF not bull") + " · " + (longVol ? "squeeze fire up" : squeezeOn ? "coiling" : "no squeeze") + " · " + (longReclaim ? "EMA25 reclaim" : longPbRes ? "pullback resume" : "no reclaim") + (bullConfluence ? " · SMC confluence" : "") + (bullLiqFuel ? " · liq fuel up" : "")
string shortWhy = (shortRegime ? "HTF bear" : "HTF not bear") + " · " + (shortVol ? "squeeze fire down" : squeezeOn ? "coiling" : "no squeeze") + " · " + (shortReject ? "EMA25 reject" : shortPbRes ? "pullback resume" : "no reject") + (bearConfluence ? " · SMC confluence" : "") + (bearLiqFuel ? " · liq fuel down" : "")

// TRADE STATE
var int tradeDir = 0
var int tradeEntryBar = na
var string tradeStatus = "WAITING"
var float tradeScore = na
var float tradeEntry = na
var float tradeSL = na
var float tradeTP1 = na
var float tradeTP2 = na
var float tradeTP3 = na
var float highestSince = na
var float lowestSince = na
var bool tp1Hit = false
var bool tp2Hit = false
var float trailATR = na
var int tradeMax = na
var string tradeWhy = "-"
var float tradeSL0 = na
var float tradeRisk0 = na
var float tradeAtr = na
var int tp1Bar = na
var int tp2Bar = na
var int tradeValid = na
var int tradeSigBar = na

// Pending plan stored at the signal bar (R-multiples; re-anchored at fill).
var float pendSL = na
var float pendTP1px = na
var float pendT1m = na
var float tradeBankedR = 0.0  // fraction of position already banked at TP1 (in R)
var float pendR2 = na
var float pendT3m = na
var float pendObs = na
var float pendAmb = na
var float pendScore = na
var string pendWhy = "-"
var int pendValid = na
var int pendSigBar = na
var float pendLimitPx = na
var int pendExp = na

float slip = slipBps / 10000.0
float costFrac = costBps / 10000.0

if longSignal
    bool isRg = rangeLong
    float rgRisk = rgStopATR * atr
    float rgT1 = f_clamp(math.abs(ema50 - close) / math.max(rgRisk, syminfo.mintick) * 1.5, 0.30, 2.20)
    pendDir := 1
    pendSL := isRg ? close - rgRisk : longStopPx
    pendTP1px := isRg ? close + rgRisk * rgT1 : longTP1p
    pendT1m := isRg ? rgT1 : longT1m
    pendR2 := isRg ? rgT1 + 0.30 : longR
    pendT3m := isRg ? rgT1 : longT3m
    pendObs := isRg ? na : longObstacle
    pendAmb := isRg ? 0.60 : longAmb
    pendScore := isRg ? 78.0 : longScore
    pendRange := isRg
    pendWhy := isRg ? "RANGE" : longWhy
    pendValid := validBars
    pendSigBar := bar_index
    pendLimitPx := pullEntryATR > 0.0 ? close - pullEntryATR * atr * (isRg ? 0.5 : 1.0) : na
    pendExp := pullEntryATR > 0.0 ? bar_index + pullWait : bar_index + 1
    label.new(bar_index, close, "\u25B2 " + (rangeLong ? "RNG LONG " : longVol ? "LONG SQ " : "LONG ") + str.tostring(rangeLong ? 78 : longScore, "#") + " " + f_conf_word(longScore, adaptiveGate) + "\nTP " + str.tostring(longTP2p, format.mintick) + " · SL " + str.tostring(longStopPx, format.mintick) + "\n" + str.tostring((longTP2p - close) / math.max(longRisk, syminfo.mintick), "#.#") + "R · ≤" + str.tostring(validBars) + "b", yloc=yloc.belowbar, style=label.style_label_up, color=color.new(C_LONG, longVol ? 0 : 12), textcolor=color.white, size=size.normal, force_overlay=true)
    float sgRef = pullEntryATR > 0.0 ? nz(pendLimitPx, close) : close
    box.new(bar_index, pendTP1px, bar_index + int(math.min(validBars, 24)), sgRef, xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(C_LONG, 88), border_color=color.new(C_LONG, 40), force_overlay=true)
    box.new(bar_index, sgRef, bar_index + int(math.min(validBars, 24)), pendSL, xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(C_SHORT, 88), border_color=color.new(C_SHORT, 40), force_overlay=true)

if shortSignal
    bool isRg = rangeShort
    float rgRisk = rgStopATR * atr
    float rgT1 = f_clamp(math.abs(ema50 - close) / math.max(rgRisk, syminfo.mintick) * 1.5, 0.30, 2.20)
    pendDir := -1
    pendSL := isRg ? close + rgRisk : shortStopPx
    pendTP1px := isRg ? close - rgRisk * rgT1 : shortTP1p
    pendT1m := isRg ? rgT1 : shortT1m
    pendR2 := isRg ? rgT1 + 0.30 : shortR
    pendT3m := isRg ? rgT1 : shortT3m
    pendObs := isRg ? na : shortObstacle
    pendAmb := isRg ? 0.60 : shortAmb
    pendScore := isRg ? 78.0 : shortScore
    pendRange := isRg
    pendWhy := isRg ? "RANGE" : shortWhy
    pendValid := validBars
    pendSigBar := bar_index
    pendLimitPx := pullEntryATR > 0.0 ? close + pullEntryATR * atr : na
    pendExp := pullEntryATR > 0.0 ? bar_index + pullWait : bar_index + 1
    label.new(bar_index, close, "\u25BC " + (rangeShort ? "RNG SHORT " : shortVol ? "SHORT SQ " : "SHORT ") + str.tostring(rangeShort ? 78 : shortScore, "#") + " " + f_conf_word(shortScore, adaptiveGate) + "\nTP " + str.tostring(shortTP2p, format.mintick) + " · SL " + str.tostring(shortStopPx, format.mintick) + "\n" + str.tostring((close - shortTP2p) / math.max(shortRisk, syminfo.mintick), "#.#") + "R · ≤" + str.tostring(validBars) + "b", yloc=yloc.abovebar, style=label.style_label_down, color=color.new(C_SHORT, shortVol ? 0 : 12), textcolor=color.white, size=size.normal, force_overlay=true)
    float sgRef = pullEntryATR > 0.0 ? nz(pendLimitPx, close) : close
    box.new(bar_index, sgRef, bar_index + int(math.min(validBars, 24)), pendSL, xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(C_SHORT, 88), border_color=color.new(C_SHORT, 40), force_overlay=true)
    box.new(bar_index, pendTP1px, bar_index + int(math.min(validBars, 24)), sgRef, xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(C_LONG, 88), border_color=color.new(C_LONG, 40), force_overlay=true)

// FILL: next bar open + slippage, or limit-pullback fill within pullWait bars.
if pendDir != 0 and bar_index > pendExp
    pendDir := 0  // order expired unfilled — signal gone stale
    if showStructure and pullEntryATR > 0.0
        label.new(bar_index, nz(pendLimitPx, close), "EXPIRED", yloc=yloc.belowbar, style=label.style_none, color=color.new(C_MUTE, 40), textcolor=color.new(C_MUTE, 0), size=size.tiny, force_overlay=true)
if pendDir != 0 and bar_index > pendSigBar
    int fillDir = pendDir
    bool filled = false
    float fillPx = na
    if pullEntryATR > 0.0
        if fillDir == 1 and low <= pendLimitPx
            filled := true
            fillPx := pendLimitPx * (1.0 + slip)
        if fillDir == -1 and high >= pendLimitPx
            filled := true
            fillPx := pendLimitPx * (1.0 - slip)
    else
        filled := true
        fillPx := fillDir == 1 ? open * (1.0 + slip) : open * (1.0 - slip)
    if filled
        float riskNow = math.abs(fillPx - pendSL)
        bool gapBad = riskNow <= syminfo.mintick or (fillDir == 1 and (fillPx <= pendSL or fillPx >= pendTP1px)) or (fillDir == -1 and (fillPx >= pendSL or fillPx <= pendTP1px))
        if gapBad
            pendDir := 0
            label.new(bar_index, fillPx, "SKIP", yloc=fillDir == 1 ? yloc.belowbar : yloc.abovebar, style=fillDir == 1 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color=color.new(C_MUTE, 40), textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny, force_overlay=true)
        else
            tradeActive := true
            tradeDir := fillDir
            tradeEntryBar := bar_index
            tradeSigBar := pendSigBar
            tradeStatus := fillDir == 1 ? "LONG ACTIVE" : "SHORT ACTIVE"
            tradeScore := pendScore
            tradeWhy := pendWhy
            tradeEntry := fillPx
            tradeRisk0 := riskNow
            tradeAtr := atr
            tradeSL := pendSL
            tradeSL0 := pendSL
            float tp2raw = fillDir == 1 ? fillPx + riskNow * pendR2 : fillPx - riskNow * pendR2
            float tp2 = tp2raw
            if fillDir == 1 and not na(pendObs) and pendObs < tp2raw and pendObs > fillPx
                tp2 := math.max(fillPx + riskNow * 0.90, pendObs - atr * 0.08)
            if fillDir == -1 and not na(pendObs) and pendObs > tp2raw and pendObs < fillPx
                tp2 := math.min(fillPx - riskNow * 0.90, pendObs + atr * 0.08)
            tradeTP1 := fillDir == 1 ? fillPx + riskNow * pendT1m : fillPx - riskNow * pendT1m
            tp2 := fillDir == 1 ? math.max(tp2, tradeTP1 + riskNow * 0.10) : math.min(tp2, tradeTP1 - riskNow * 0.10)
            tradeTP2 := tp2
            tradeTP3 := fillDir == 1 ? fillPx + riskNow * pendT3m : fillPx - riskNow * pendT3m
            tp1Bar := na
            tp2Bar := na
            tradeValid := pendValid
            highestSince := high
            lowestSince := low
            tp1Hit := false
            tp2Hit := false
            tradeBankedR := 0.0
            float gbTighten = not na(loseMfeMed) and loseMfeMed > pendR2 * 0.55 ? 0.80 : 1.0
            trailATR := (1.80 + 1.00 * pendAmb) * gbTighten
            tradeMax := na(medDur) ? int(math.round(effHoldBars * (0.70 + 0.50 * pendAmb))) : int(math.round(f_clamp(medDur * 1.8, 16.0, effHoldBars)))
            if pendRange
                tradeMax := math.min(tradeMax, 24)
            tradeRange := pendRange
            pendDir := 0

if tradeActive and bar_index >= tradeEntryBar
    highestSince := math.max(nz(highestSince, high), high)
    lowestSince := math.min(nz(lowestSince, low), low)
    int held = bar_index - tradeEntryBar
    if tradeDir == 1
        bool stopHit = low <= tradeSL
        bool t1 = high >= tradeTP1
        bool t2 = high >= tradeTP2
        bool t3 = high >= tradeTP3
        if stopHit
            tradeActive := false
            tradeStatus := tp2Hit ? "LONG TRAIL" : tp1Hit ? "LONG PROTECTED" : "LONG SL"
        else if t3
            tradeActive := false
            tp1Hit := true
            tp2Hit := true
            tradeStatus := "LONG TP3"
        else
            if t2
                tp1Hit := true
                tp2Hit := true
                tradeStatus := "LONG RUNNER"
            else if t1
                tp1Hit := true
                tradeStatus := "LONG TP1"
            if tp1Hit and tradeBankedR == 0.0 and profTp1Frac > 0.0
                tradeBankedR := profTp1Frac * pendT1m
            if tp1Hit and protectAfterTP1
                tradeSL := math.max(tradeSL, tradeEntry + math.max(atr * 0.02, tradeRisk0 * lGb))
            if tp2Hit and trailAfterTP2
                tradeSL := math.max(tradeSL, highestSince - atr * trailATR)
            if not tradeRange and not h1Bull and held >= 2
                tradeActive := false
                tradeStatus := "LONG FLIP"
            if held >= tradeMax
                tradeActive := false
                tradeStatus := "LONG TIME"
    else
        bool stopHit = high >= tradeSL
        bool t1 = low <= tradeTP1
        bool t2 = low <= tradeTP2
        bool t3 = low <= tradeTP3
        if stopHit
            tradeActive := false
            tradeStatus := tp2Hit ? "SHORT TRAIL" : tp1Hit ? "SHORT PROTECTED" : "SHORT SL"
        else if t3
            tradeActive := false
            tp1Hit := true
            tp2Hit := true
            tradeStatus := "SHORT TP3"
        else
            if t2
                tp1Hit := true
                tp2Hit := true
                tradeStatus := "SHORT RUNNER"
            else if t1
                tp1Hit := true
                tradeStatus := "SHORT TP1"
            if tp1Hit and tradeBankedR == 0.0 and profTp1Frac > 0.0
                tradeBankedR := profTp1Frac * pendT1m
            if tp1Hit and protectAfterTP1
                tradeSL := math.min(tradeSL, tradeEntry - atr * 0.02)
            if tp2Hit and trailAfterTP2
                tradeSL := math.min(tradeSL, lowestSince + atr * trailATR * sTrailM)
            if not tradeRange and not h1Bear and held >= 2
                tradeActive := false
                tradeStatus := "SHORT FLIP"
            if held >= tradeMax
                tradeActive := false
                tradeStatus := "SHORT TIME"
    if tp1Hit and na(tp1Bar)
        tp1Bar := bar_index
    if tp2Hit and na(tp2Bar)
        tp2Bar := bar_index

// ON CLOSE: learn from the trade, then paint it on history.
var array<box> histBoxes = array.new<box>()
var array<label> histLabs = array.new<label>()

// Close detector keys on a recorded-but-inactive trade, not the tradeActive
// edge — a same-bar fill+close would otherwise be dropped from all stats.
if not tradeActive and tradeDir != 0 and not na(tradeEntry) and not na(tradeRisk0) and tradeRisk0 > 0.0
    bool mktExit = str.contains(tradeStatus, "TIME") or str.contains(tradeStatus, "FLIP")
    bool stopExit = str.contains(tradeStatus, "SL") or str.contains(tradeStatus, "PROTECTED") or str.contains(tradeStatus, "TRAIL")
    float rawExit = str.contains(tradeStatus, "TP3") ? tradeTP3 : mktExit ? close : tradeSL
    // Market and stop exits pay slippage; the TP3 limit does not.
    float exitPx = rawExit * (stopExit or mktExit ? (tradeDir == 1 ? 1.0 - slip : 1.0 + slip) : 1.0)
    float costR = tradeEntry * costFrac / tradeRisk0
    float runnerR = tradeDir == 1 ? (exitPx - tradeEntry) / tradeRisk0 : (tradeEntry - exitPx) / tradeRisk0
    // TP1 partial: bank profTp1Frac at TP1, the runner exits here.
    float banked = tp1Hit ? profTp1Frac * pendT1m : tradeBankedR
    float realR = (banked > 0.0 ? banked + (1.0 - profTp1Frac) * runnerR : runnerR) - costR
    float mfeR = tradeDir == 1 ? (highestSince - tradeEntry) / tradeRisk0 : (tradeEntry - lowestSince) / tradeRisk0
    float maeAtr = tradeDir == 1 ? (tradeEntry - lowestSince) / math.max(tradeAtr, syminfo.mintick) : (highestSince - tradeEntry) / math.max(tradeAtr, syminfo.mintick)
    float durB = bar_index - tradeEntryBar
    array.push(statMfeR, math.max(mfeR, 0.0))
    array.push(statRealR, realR)
    array.push(statDur, durB)
    array.push(statTp1Win, tp1Hit ? 1.0 : 0.0)
    if tradeDir == 1
        array.push(statRealL, realR)
    else
        array.push(statRealS, realR)
    if realR > 0.0
        array.push(statMaeWin, math.max(maeAtr, 0.0))
    else
        array.push(statMfeLose, math.max(mfeR, 0.0))
    if tp1Hit and not na(tp1Bar)
        array.push(statTp1Dur, tp1Bar - tradeEntryBar)
    lossStreak := realR <= 0.0 ? lossStreak + 1 : 0
    if array.size(statMfeR) > 48
        array.shift(statMfeR)
        array.shift(statRealR)
        array.shift(statDur)
        array.shift(statTp1Win)
    if array.size(statRealL) > 48
        array.shift(statRealL)
    if array.size(statRealS) > 48
        array.shift(statRealS)
    if array.size(statMaeWin) > 48
        array.shift(statMaeWin)
    if array.size(statMfeLose) > 48
        array.shift(statMfeLose)
    if array.size(statTp1Dur) > 48
        array.shift(statTp1Dur)
    if showStructure
        array.push(histBoxes, box.new(tradeEntryBar, math.max(tradeEntry, tradeSL0), bar_index, math.min(tradeEntry, tradeSL0), xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(C_SHORT, 92), border_color=color.new(C_SHORT, 60), force_overlay=true))
        array.push(histBoxes, box.new(tradeEntryBar, math.max(tradeEntry, tradeTP2), bar_index, math.min(tradeEntry, tradeTP2), xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(C_LONG, 92), border_color=color.new(C_LONG, 60), force_overlay=true))
        array.push(histLabs, label.new(bar_index, exitPx, (realR >= 0.0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(realR, "#.##") + "R · " + str.tostring(durB, "#") + "b", xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(realR >= 0.0 ? C_LONG : C_SHORT, 18), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.tiny, force_overlay=true))
        if array.size(histBoxes) > 24
            box.delete(array.shift(histBoxes))
            box.delete(array.shift(histBoxes))
        if array.size(histLabs) > 12
            label.delete(array.shift(histLabs))

if not tradeActive and tradeDir != 0
    lastSignalBar := bar_index
    tradeDir := 0
    tradeEntry := na
    tradeSL := na
    tradeTP1 := na
    tradeTP2 := na
    tradeTP3 := na
    tradeSL0 := na
    tradeRisk0 := na
    tradeAtr := na
    // tp1Bar/tp2Bar intentionally NOT reset here — they carry the last event
    // bar for alerts (re-armed to na at the next fill).
    tp1Hit := false
    tp2Hit := false
    highestSince := na
    lowestSince := na
    trailATR := na
    tradeMax := na
    tradeRange := false
    tradeValid := na
    tradeSigBar := na

// CHART
p25 = plot(ema25, "EMA 25", color=C_INFO, linewidth=2, force_overlay=true)
p50 = plot(ema50, "EMA 50", color=#818cf8, linewidth=2, force_overlay=true)
fill(p25, p50, color=ema25 > ema50 ? color.new(C_LONG, 94) : color.new(C_SHORT, 94), title="Trend cloud")
plot(ema200, "EMA 200", color=#64748b, linewidth=1, force_overlay=true)
plot(vwap, "VWAP", color=#e2e8f0, linewidth=1, force_overlay=true)

float planEntryPx = tradeActive ? tradeEntry : pendDir != 0 and not na(pendLimitPx) ? pendLimitPx : close
float planSLPx = tradeActive ? tradeSL : pendDir != 0 and not na(pendSL) ? pendSL : previewSL
float planTP1Px = tradeActive ? tradeTP1 : previewTP1
float planTP2Px = tradeActive ? tradeTP2 : previewTP2
int planDirNow = tradeActive ? tradeDir : pendDir != 0 ? pendDir : previewDir
float planRNow = pendDir != 0 and not na(pendR2) ? pendR2 : previewR
if tradeActive and not na(tradeEntry) and not na(tradeSL) and not na(tradeTP2)
    planRNow := tradeDir == 1 ? (tradeTP2 - tradeEntry) / math.max(tradeEntry - tradeSL, syminfo.mintick) : (tradeEntry - tradeTP2) / math.max(tradeSL - tradeEntry, syminfo.mintick)
// Standing plan lines only when there's a live trade, a pending fill, or the
// leading side's score is near the gate — a "PLAN" on a dead chart is noise.
bool showPlan = tradeActive or pendDir != 0 or (planDirNow == 1 ? longScore >= adaptiveGate - 10.0 : shortScore >= adaptiveGate - 10.0)

pEntry = plot(tradeActive ? tradeEntry : na, "Entry", color=color.white, linewidth=1, style=plot.style_linebr, force_overlay=true)
pSL = plot(tradeActive ? tradeSL : na, "Stop", color=C_SHORT, linewidth=2, style=plot.style_linebr, force_overlay=true)
pTP1 = plot(tradeActive ? tradeTP1 : na, "TP1", color=C_LONG, linewidth=1, style=plot.style_linebr, force_overlay=true)
pTP2 = plot(tradeActive ? tradeTP2 : na, "TP2", color=color.new(C_LONG, 10), linewidth=2, style=plot.style_linebr, force_overlay=true)
plot(tradeActive ? tradeTP3 : na, "TP3", color=color.new(C_LONG, 40), linewidth=1, style=plot.style_linebr, force_overlay=true)
fill(pEntry, pSL, color=tradeActive ? color.new(C_SHORT, 88) : na, title="Risk")
fill(pEntry, pTP1, color=tradeActive ? color.new(C_LONG, 92) : na, title="First target")

var line lnIn = na
var line lnSL = na
var line lnTP = na
var box obBox = na
var box fvgBox = na
var label lbE25 = na
var label lbE50 = na
var label lbVwap = na
var label lbIn = na
var label lbSL = na
var label lbTP = na
var label lbOB = na
var label lbFVG = na
var array<box> heatBoxes = array.new<box>()
var array<label> heatLabs = array.new<label>()

if barstate.islast
    if not na(lnIn)
        line.delete(lnIn)
    if not na(lnSL)
        line.delete(lnSL)
    if not na(lnTP)
        line.delete(lnTP)
    if not na(obBox)
        box.delete(obBox)
    if not na(fvgBox)
        box.delete(fvgBox)
    if not na(lbE25)
        label.delete(lbE25)
    if not na(lbE50)
        label.delete(lbE50)
    if not na(lbVwap)
        label.delete(lbVwap)
    if not na(lbIn)
        label.delete(lbIn)
    if not na(lbSL)
        label.delete(lbSL)
    if not na(lbTP)
        label.delete(lbTP)
    if not na(lbOB)
        label.delete(lbOB)
    if not na(lbFVG)
        label.delete(lbFVG)
    int nHeat = array.size(heatBoxes)
    if nHeat > 0
        for i = 0 to nHeat - 1
            box.delete(array.get(heatBoxes, i))
        array.clear(heatBoxes)
    int nHLab = array.size(heatLabs)
    if nHLab > 0
        for j = 0 to nHLab - 1
            label.delete(array.get(heatLabs, j))
        array.clear(heatLabs)
    if showStructure and not na(obTop) and not na(obBot) and not na(obBar)
        obBox := box.new(obBar, obTop, bar_index + 12, obBot, xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(obDir == 1 ? C_LONG : C_SHORT, 88), border_color=color.new(obDir == 1 ? C_LONG : C_SHORT, 40), force_overlay=true)
        lbOB := label.new(obBar, obTop, obDir == 1 ? "OB bull" : "OB bear", xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(obDir == 1 ? C_LONG : C_SHORT, 20), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_down, size=size.tiny, force_overlay=true)
    if showStructure and not na(fvgTop) and not na(fvgBot) and not na(fvgBar)
        fvgBox := box.new(fvgBar, fvgTop, bar_index + 12, fvgBot, xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(fvgDir == 1 ? C_LONG : C_SHORT, 90), border_color=color.new(fvgDir == 1 ? C_LONG : C_SHORT, 45), border_style=line.style_dashed, force_overlay=true)
        lbFVG := label.new(fvgBar, fvgTop, fvgDir == 1 ? "FVG bull" : "FVG bear", xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(fvgDir == 1 ? C_LONG : C_SHORT, 25), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_down, size=size.tiny, force_overlay=true)
    if showLiqMap
        float heatHalf = math.max(atr * 0.20, close * 0.0012)
        int hx = not na(lastPHBar) ? lastPHBar : bar_index - 20
        int lx = not na(lastPLBar) ? lastPLBar : bar_index - 20
        if not na(shortMagnet) and shortMagnet > close
            int upTrans = shortLiqDens >= 3 ? 70 : shortLiqDens >= 2 ? 78 : 88
            bool upPool = not na(lastPH) and math.abs(shortMagnet - lastPH) <= liqBand
            string upTxt = actualShortLiq ? "LIQ↑ SPIKE" : shortLiqDens >= 2 ? "LIQ↑ HOT" : upPool ? "STOPS↑" : "LIQ↑"
            array.push(heatBoxes, box.new(hx, shortMagnet + heatHalf, bar_index + 10, shortMagnet - heatHalf, xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(C_SHORT, upTrans), border_color=color.new(C_SHORT, 30), force_overlay=true))
            array.push(heatLabs, label.new(bar_index + 1, shortMagnet, upTxt, xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(C_SHORT, 10), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.tiny, force_overlay=true))
        float up2 = na
        if not na(sh25) and sh25 > close and (na(shortMagnet) or math.abs(sh25 - shortMagnet) > liqBand)
            up2 := sh25
        else if not na(shH4) and shH4 > close and (na(shortMagnet) or math.abs(shH4 - shortMagnet) > liqBand)
            up2 := shH4
        up2 := f_near_price(up2, atr)
        if not na(up2)
            array.push(heatBoxes, box.new(hx, up2 + heatHalf, bar_index + 10, up2 - heatHalf, xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(C_SHORT, 88), border_color=color.new(C_SHORT, 45), force_overlay=true))
            array.push(heatLabs, label.new(bar_index + 1, up2, "LIQ↑ 25x", xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(C_SHORT, 25), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.tiny, force_overlay=true))
        if not na(longMagnet) and longMagnet < close
            int dnTrans = longLiqDens >= 3 ? 70 : longLiqDens >= 2 ? 78 : 88
            bool dnPool = not na(lastPL) and math.abs(longMagnet - lastPL) <= liqBand
            string dnTxt = actualLongLiq ? "LIQ↓ SPIKE" : longLiqDens >= 2 ? "LIQ↓ HOT" : dnPool ? "STOPS↓" : "LIQ↓"
            array.push(heatBoxes, box.new(lx, longMagnet + heatHalf, bar_index + 10, longMagnet - heatHalf, xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(C_SUP, dnTrans), border_color=color.new(C_SUP, 30), force_overlay=true))
            array.push(heatLabs, label.new(bar_index + 1, longMagnet, dnTxt, xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(C_SUP, 10), textcolor=color.black, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.tiny, force_overlay=true))
        float dn2 = na
        if not na(lg25) and lg25 < close and (na(longMagnet) or math.abs(lg25 - longMagnet) > liqBand)
            dn2 := lg25
        else if not na(lgH4) and lgH4 < close and (na(longMagnet) or math.abs(lgH4 - longMagnet) > liqBand)
            dn2 := lgH4
        dn2 := f_near_price(dn2, atr)
        if not na(dn2)
            array.push(heatBoxes, box.new(lx, dn2 + heatHalf, bar_index + 10, dn2 - heatHalf, xloc=xloc.bar_index, bgcolor=color.new(C_SUP, 88), border_color=color.new(C_SUP, 45), force_overlay=true))
            array.push(heatLabs, label.new(bar_index + 1, dn2, "LIQ↓ 25x", xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(C_SUP, 25), textcolor=color.black, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.tiny, force_overlay=true))
    lbE25 := label.new(bar_index + 1, ema25, "25", xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(C_INFO, 20), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.small, force_overlay=true)
    lbE50 := label.new(bar_index + 1, ema50, "50", xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(#818cf8, 20), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.small, force_overlay=true)
    lbVwap := label.new(bar_index + 1, vwap, "VWAP", xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(#e2e8f0, 25), textcolor=color.black, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.small, force_overlay=true)
    if showPlan
        lnIn := line.new(bar_index, planEntryPx, bar_index + 6, planEntryPx, xloc=xloc.bar_index, extend=extend.right, color=color.new(#e2e8f0, tradeActive ? 10 : 40), width=1, force_overlay=true)
        lnSL := line.new(bar_index, planSLPx, bar_index + 6, planSLPx, xloc=xloc.bar_index, extend=extend.right, color=color.new(C_SHORT, tradeActive ? 0 : 25), width=2, force_overlay=true)
        lnTP := line.new(bar_index, planTP2Px, bar_index + 6, planTP2Px, xloc=xloc.bar_index, extend=extend.right, color=color.new(C_LONG, tradeActive ? 0 : 25), width=2, force_overlay=true)
        lbIn := label.new(bar_index + 1, planEntryPx, tradeActive ? "IN" : pendDir != 0 ? (pendRange ? "RNG LIMIT" : pullEntryATR > 0.0 ? "LIMIT" : "PENDING") : (planDirNow == 1 ? "LONG PLAN" : "SHORT PLAN"), xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(#e2e8f0, 15), textcolor=color.black, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.small, force_overlay=true)
        lbSL := label.new(bar_index + 1, planSLPx, "SL", xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(C_SHORT, 0), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.small, force_overlay=true)
        lbTP := label.new(bar_index + 1, planTP2Px, "TP " + str.tostring(planRNow, "#.#") + "R · ~" + str.tostring(tradeActive and not na(tradeValid) ? tradeValid : validBars) + "b" + (na(learnedStopATR) ? "" : " · SL " + str.tostring(adaptiveStopATR, "#.##") + "A"), xloc=xloc.bar_index, color=color.new(C_LONG, 0), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.small, force_overlay=true)

plotshape(sweepLow, "Sweep low", shape.diamond, location.belowbar, color.new(C_LONG, 20), size=size.tiny, show_last=24, force_overlay=true)
plotshape(sweepHigh, "Sweep high", shape.diamond, location.abovebar, color.new(C_SHORT, 20), size=size.tiny, show_last=24, force_overlay=true)
plotshape(bosUp, "BOS up", shape.triangleup, location.belowbar, C_LONG, size=size.tiny, show_last=16, force_overlay=true)
plotshape(bosDn, "BOS down", shape.triangledown, location.abovebar, C_SHORT, size=size.tiny, show_last=16, force_overlay=true)

// PANE: conviction / RSI / squeeze / liq fuel. Small shared scale, never price.
float netConv = longScore - shortScore
float liqPane = f_clamp(liqFuel * 6.0, -18.0, 18.0)
bgcolor(chopVeto ? color.new(C_WARN, 92) : netConv >= 12 ? color.new(C_LONG, 92) : netConv <= -12 ? color.new(C_SHORT, 92) : na)
pConv = plot(netConv, "Conviction", style=plot.style_columns, color=netConv >= 0 ? color.new(C_LONG, 20) : color.new(C_SHORT, 20), histbase=0.0)
pZero = plot(0.0, "Zero", color=color.new(#e2e8f0, 40), linewidth=1)
fill(pConv, pZero, color=netConv >= 0 ? color.new(C_LONG, 78) : color.new(C_SHORT, 78), title="Edge")
plot(rsi - 50.0, "RSI bias", color=rsi >= 70 ? C_SHORT : rsi <= 30 ? C_LONG : #94a3b8, linewidth=2)
plot(squeezeOn ? 0.0 : na, "Squeeze", style=plot.style_circles, color=C_WARN, linewidth=3)
plotshape(squeezeFire ? 0.0 : na, "Squeeze fire", shape.diamond, location.absolute, color=squeezeMom >= 0 ? C_LONG : C_SHORT, size=size.tiny)
plot(liqPane, "Liq fuel", color=liqPane > 0 ? color.new(C_FUELUP, 20) : color.new(C_FUELDN, 20), linewidth=2)
plotshape(bullLiqFuel ? 12.0 : na, "Liq fuel up", shape.triangleup, location.absolute, C_FUELUP, size=size.tiny)
plotshape(bearLiqFuel ? -12.0 : na, "Liq fuel down", shape.triangledown, location.absolute, C_FUELDN, size=size.tiny)
hline(20, "Long edge", color=color.new(C_LONG, 55), linestyle=hline.style_dotted)
hline(-20, "Short edge", color=color.new(C_SHORT, 55), linestyle=hline.style_dotted)

// HUD
string decision = longSignal ? "LONG" : shortSignal ? "SHORT" : waitReason
color decisionBg = longSignal or (tradeActive and tradeDir == 1) ? color.new(C_LONG, 0) : shortSignal or (tradeActive and tradeDir == -1) ? color.new(C_SHORT, 0) : str.contains(waitReason, "CHOP") or str.contains(waitReason, "NO ") or str.contains(waitReason, "LEARNED") ? color.new(C_WARN, 5) : color.new(#1e293b, 0)
string confNow = tradeActive ? f_conf_word(tradeScore, adaptiveGate) + " " + str.tostring(tradeScore, "#") : "L" + str.tostring(longScore, "#") + "  S" + str.tostring(shortScore, "#")
string whyNow = tradeActive ? tradeWhy : longScore >= shortScore ? longWhy : shortWhy
string planTxt = (tradeActive ? tradeStatus : pendDir != 0 ? (pendRange ? "RNG LIMIT" : pullEntryATR > 0.0 ? "LIMIT" : "PENDING") : (planDirNow == 1 ? "LONG PLAN" : "SHORT PLAN")) + "  " + str.tostring(planRNow, "#.#") + "R  IN " + str.tostring(planEntryPx, format.mintick) + "  SL " + str.tostring(planSLPx, format.mintick) + "  TP " + str.tostring(planTP2Px, format.mintick) + "  valid ~" + str.tostring(tradeActive and not na(tradeValid) ? tradeValid : validBars) + "b"
string sqTxt = squeezeOn ? "SQUEEZE " + str.tostring(squeezeBars) + "b" : longVol ? "FIRE UP" : shortVol ? "FIRE DN" : "NO SQUEEZE"
int selfN = array.size(statRealR)
float tp1Rate = array.size(statTp1Win) > 0 ? array.avg(statTp1Win) * 100.0 : na
float avgR = selfN > 0 ? array.avg(statRealR) : na
float sdR = selfN >= 3 ? array.stdev(statRealR) : na
float tstatR = selfN >= 3 and not na(sdR) and sdR > 0.0 ? avgR / (sdR / math.sqrt(selfN)) : na
float winSumL = 0.0
float loseSumL = 0.0
if nL > 0
    for i = 0 to nL - 1
        float v = array.get(statRealL, i)
        if v > 0.0
            winSumL += v
        else
            loseSumL += -v
float winSumS = 0.0
float loseSumS = 0.0
if nS > 0
    for i = 0 to nS - 1
        float v = array.get(statRealS, i)
        if v > 0.0
            winSumS += v
        else
            loseSumS += -v
float pfL = loseSumL > 0.0 ? winSumL / loseSumL : winSumL > 0.0 ? 99.0 : na
float pfS = loseSumS > 0.0 ? winSumS / loseSumS : winSumS > 0.0 ? 99.0 : na
float h1Avg = na
float h2Avg = na
if selfN >= 8
    int half = int(selfN / 2)
    float s1 = 0.0
    float s2 = 0.0
    for i = 0 to selfN - 1
        float v = array.get(statRealR, i)
        if i < half
            s1 += v
        else
            s2 += v
    h1Avg := s1 / half
    h2Avg := s2 / (selfN - half)
int sigCount = int(ta.cum((longSignal or shortSignal) ? 1.0 : 0.0))
string learnTxt = (dirLongLearnedOff ? "L-OFF " : "") + (dirShortLearnedOff ? "S-OFF " : "") + (na(learnedStopATR) ? "" : "SL " + str.tostring(adaptiveStopATR, "#.##") + "A ") + (selfN >= 10 ? "TP learned" : "TP prior")
string histTxt = str.tostring(sigCount) + " sig · " + str.tostring(selfN) + " closed" + (selfN == 0 ? " — none yet on this chart" : " · TP1 " + str.tostring(tp1Rate, "#") + "% · avg " + (avgR >= 0.0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(avgR, "#.##") + "R · L" + str.tostring(nL) + "/" + str.tostring(pfL, "#.#") + " S" + str.tostring(nS) + "/" + str.tostring(pfS, "#.#"))

var table hud = table.new(position.top_right, 3, 6, bgcolor=color.new(C_HUD, 8), frame_color=color.new(#334155, 35), frame_width=1, border_width=0, force_overlay=true)
if barstate.islast
    string cycLbl = not btcOn ? "n/a" : btcCycBull ? "BULL " + str.tostring(int(btcPos4y * 100)) + "%" : btcCycBear ? "BEAR " + str.tostring(int(btcPos4y * 100)) + "%" : "TRANS " + str.tostring(int(btcPos4y * 100)) + "%"
    table.cell(hud, 0, 0, decision, bgcolor=decisionBg, text_color=color.white, text_halign=text.align_left, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(hud, 1, 0, confNow, bgcolor=decisionBg, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(hud, 2, 0, profile + " " + timeframe.period, bgcolor=decisionBg, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(hud, 0, 1, "Score ≥ " + str.tostring(adaptiveGate, "#"), bgcolor=C_ROW, text_color=C_MUTE, text_halign=text.align_left, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(hud, 1, 1, "L " + str.tostring(longScore, "#") + (dirLongLearnedOff ? " OFF" : ""), bgcolor=dirLongLearnedOff ? color.new(C_WARN, 20) : f_score_bg(longScore, adaptiveGate), text_color=color.white, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(hud, 2, 1, "S " + str.tostring(shortScore, "#") + (dirShortLearnedOff ? " OFF" : ""), bgcolor=dirShortLearnedOff ? color.new(C_WARN, 20) : f_score_bg(shortScore, adaptiveGate), text_color=color.white, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(hud, 0, 2, "Cycle " + btcAnchor, bgcolor=C_HUD, text_color=C_MUTE, text_halign=text.align_left, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(hud, 1, 2, cycLbl, bgcolor=btcCycBull ? color.new(C_LONG, 20) : btcCycBear ? color.new(C_SHORT, 20) : C_ROW, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(hud, 2, 2, (f_yn(longRegime) + " regime / " + f_yn(shortRegime)), bgcolor=C_ROW, text_color=C_TEXT, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(hud, 0, 3, whyNow, bgcolor=C_ROW, text_color=C_TEXT, text_halign=text.align_left, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(hud, 1, 3, "", bgcolor=C_ROW)
    table.cell(hud, 2, 3, "", bgcolor=C_ROW)
    table.cell(hud, 0, 4, planTxt, bgcolor=C_HUD, text_color=C_MUTE, text_halign=text.align_left, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(hud, 1, 4, "", bgcolor=C_HUD)
    table.cell(hud, 2, 4, "", bgcolor=C_HUD)
    table.cell(hud, 0, 5, histTxt, bgcolor=C_ROW, text_color=selfN > 0 and not na(avgR) and avgR > 0.0 ? color.new(C_LONG, 20) : C_MUTE, text_halign=text.align_left, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(hud, 1, 5, "", bgcolor=C_ROW)
    table.cell(hud, 2, 5, "", bgcolor=C_ROW)

alertcondition(longSignal, "V18 LONG", "Signals V18 LONG. Confirmed close. Entry = LIMIT order at the LIMIT line (pullback), valid ~5 bars — do not chase. Read why/score before acting.")
alertcondition(shortSignal, "V18 SHORT", "Signals V18 SHORT. Confirmed close. Entry = LIMIT order at the LIMIT line (pullback), valid ~5 bars — do not chase. Read why/score before acting.")
alertcondition(not na(tp1Bar) and tp1Bar == bar_index, "V18 TP1", "Signals V18 TP1.")
alertcondition(not na(tp2Bar) and tp2Bar == bar_index, "V18 TP2", "Signals V18 TP2 / runner.")
alertcondition((dirLongLearnedOff and not dirLongLearnedOff[1]) or (dirShortLearnedOff and not dirShortLearnedOff[1]), "V18 DIR OFF", "Signals V18: a direction was learned off by this chart's closed sim trades.")

